<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Samwilu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha kaidi cha Samwilu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samwilu</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">Chitabu cha kaidi cha</para>
  <para style="mt2">Samwilu</para>
  <para style="mt3">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha kaidi cha Samwilu chajendeleza ntamulizi ye Chitabu cha nkongo cha Samwilu kumlanga seuta Daudi. Kaula ulongozi mwe Chitabu cha nkongo cha Samwilu. Daudi ni chilongozi amanyikise. Mo ulongozi wakwe, isi ya Izulaeli yendaga na nguvu. Daudi awonekaga ni mntu mta uzumizi utogesa na kumvikila Chohile. Mna hamwenga neivyo usokezi wakwe iviya haufisigwe. Kaula 11:1-12:12. Ntamulizi ye chitabu chino yatintisa kugamba udahi na ulongozi ukudaha kuchumilwa vyalawa kwa Chohile. Chilongozi ywa Izulaeli nakalongoza hantu ha Chohile nkasankana kwa Chohile. Elo kuhitukila kulawa ulongozi wa walamuzi kutenda masuta vilamulwa ni Chohile. 1 Samwilu 8:7, 22.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">1. Ulongozi walongoile Daudi, Sula 1-4</para>
  <para style="io">2. Useuta wa Izulaeli ukalongozwa ni seuta Daudi, sula ya 5-10</para>
  <para style="io">3. Seuta Daudi na Batisheba, sula 11-12</para>
  <para style="io">4. Mabuli yehiye mwa awantu we ikaya ya Daudi, sula 13-20</para>
  <para style="io">5. Ntamulizi ya kongezeza, sula 21-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Daudi agambilwa file ya Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Sauli eze abanike, Daudi na wantu wakwe niyo wauya weze wajike kuwahuda Waamaleki, wekalaga uko Sikilagi kwa mazuwa maidi. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Zuwa dya katatu, mntu yumwenga kulawa kwe dilago dya Sauli, suche zakwe kazitatula kwa chinyulu naho akatenda na lumbi komtwi kambasa Daudi. Eze ambwile Daudi, kedula hasi, niyo amfikila madi.<verse eid="2SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Daudi Niyo amuza, “Walawa kuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Amhitula, “Sisumka kulawa kwedilago dya Waizulaeli.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Daudi amgamba, “Nigambila izimbuli ivyo zijendile uko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Yudya mntu niyo amhitula, “Wagomba nkodo wetu wanyilika nkondo na watuhu walozize wakomwa. Kujinka ayo, Sauli na mwanawe Yonasani nawo wakomwa.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Daudi niyo amuza yudya mbwanga, “Kuvimanya zeze kugamba Sauli na mwanawe Yonasani wakomwa?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Yudya mbwanga niyo amhitula, “Miye nendile ni kolugulu lwa Giliboa. Simwona Sauli kegamila idiguha dyakwe na malingisha ya awankondo wakwe nendile yakamsogeleisa.” <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Sauli eze ahituke kunyuma na kuniwona, kanitanga, nize nimwitike, <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />niyo anuza “Niweye yuhi?” Niyo namhitula, “Miye ni mntu ywa Amaleki.” <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />“Aho, niyo anigamba, ‘Sogela unikome kwaviya silumizwa vihiye, ulumi huwona utendesa. Mna nichei mjima.’” <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />“Ivyo, niyo namsogeila na kumkoma, kwaviya nahamanya chindedi kugamba anagwa hasi, hadahe kutenda mjima vituhu. Mna ichilemba chendile mo mtwi wakwe ne ididanga dyendile momkono wakwe, vyose sikwigaila weye, seuta ywangu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Daudi niyo atatula izisuche zakwe kulagisa ana chinyulu. Wantu wendile hamwenga na Daudi niyo wadamanya seivyo. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Niyo waila na kulomboleza na kufunga kubula chisingi kwachausa che ifile ya Sauli hamwenga na Yonasani mwanawe, ne isi ya Waizulaeli wantu wa Chohile, kwaviya walozize wawo wakomwa kwenkondo.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Daudi niyo amuza yudya mbwanga amgambile, “Walawa kuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Niyo amhitula, “Miye ni mntu ywa Amaleki, mna nekala mweisi yako saviya mjeni.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Daudi niyo amuza, “Vitenda zeze weye hogohe kuchulusa umkono wako na kumkoma mntu asagulwe ni Chohile kwa kuhakwa mavuta?” <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Vikaheza, Daudi niyo amwitanga yumwenga ywa wambwanga wakwe amgamba, “Mkome yuno mntu.” Mbwanga uyo niyo amtowa yudya mntu ywa Amaleki na kumkoma. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Daudi niyo amgamba, “Ifile yako kwehosa mwenye. Kwaviya kutambalisa wemwenye kwa mlomo wako ukagamba, ‘Simkoma mntu asagulwe ni Chohile kwa kumhaka mavuta.’”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi awalombolezeza Sauli na Yonasani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Daudi niyo achema nchemo ya kulomboleza kwachausa cha Sauli na Yonasani mwanawe, <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />Daudi niyo alagiza kugamba wantu wa Yuda wahinywe inchemo iyo, nayo iwandikwa mwe chitabu cha Yashali. Daudi achemaga.<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Weye Izulaeli wantu ukwefenyeza, wakomelwa kwamagulu yako!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Wakankalu wadahile kugomba nkondo wagwa vivihi!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Mbuli iyo msekuwagambila awekazi womzi wa Gati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">ne izikaya za Ashikeloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">Hegu sivyo wavyele wa Wafilisiti nawavine, wachiche wa wantu hewemmanyize Chohile welelwe.”<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />“Nyuwe magulu ya Giliboa, msekutenda na mnyuzu hegu fula mlanga mwenyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Hegu izinkonde zenyu zisekujeza kweleka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Kwaviya nchinga za mkankalu zajelagwa uzavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">nchinga ya Sauli haihakigwe mavuta ng'o.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Mifulo ya Yonasani haijezize kuhonya neikalasa du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">bamba dya Sauli hadyendaga na mbazi, mazuwa yose dikoma walozize. Heye vikoma wankondo wakankalu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />“Sauli na Yonasani, wantu wa kwehela na wakuwagizwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Mowikazi wawo no mokubanika hawapagulane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Nawahuha kujinka gushu, chindedi, wata nguvu kujinka kala.”<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />“Wavyele wa Izulaeli, mwilileni Sauli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">Nakawavisani suche zinkundu za yombe kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">nakadolonya izisuche zenyu kwa zahabu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />“Wakankalu wagwa vivihi kwenkondo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Wakomwa wakatenda kwenkondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonasani kakomwa kolugulu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Nnachinyulu mo moyo kwachausa chako, mlukolo ywangu Yonasani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">Kutenda kwangu mazuwa yose mntu ywa kuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">ungi wako kwangu utenda wa kwehela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">wa kwehela kujinka wa mvyele.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />“Wakankalu wagwele vivihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:27">viziha vyawo vyasigwa, hevina ndima.”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Daudi atendwa seuta ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Mbuli izo zize zijinke, Daudi niyo amuza Chohile, “Togola nite kwemzi umwe mwe mizi ya Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Chohile niyo amhitula, “Hita!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Daudi niyo amuza, “Nite komzi uhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Chohile niyo amhitula, “Hita komzi wa Hebuloni.” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Ivyo Daudi niyo aita Hebuloni, hamwenga na awavyele wakwe waidi, Ahinoamu kulawa komzi wa Yezileli, na Abigaili, mwasigwa ywa Nabali kulawa komzi wa Kalimeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Iviya kawaguha awagomba nkondo wakwe, chila mntu hamwenga na awantu we ikaya ywakwe, niyo wadamanya wikazi wawo mwe mizi yendile mpezo mwa Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Wantu wa Yuda wambasaga Daudi uko Hebuloni niyo wamhaka mavuta atende seuta ywawo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Daudi eze eve kugamba wantu wa Yabeshi Gileyadi nawo wamhambile Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />niyo asigila walosi wegale ulosi Yabeshi uko Gileyadi. “Zumbe Chohile awajimbikeni kwaviya mlagisa kunyanyahala kwenyu kwa Sauli, sekulu ywenyu, kwa kumhamba, <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />haluse Zumbe Chohile awadamanyizeni yedi na kutenda mkanuni mwenyu. Miye nani naniwadamanyizeni yedi kwa mbuli mtendile. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Haluse mtoge na kutenda wakankalu. Sauli seuta ywenyu kabanika, wantu wa Yuda wanisagula nitende seuta ywawo kwa kunihaka mavuta.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti atendwa seuta ywa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Abineli mwana ywa Neli, mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo wa Sauli nendile kamguha Ishibosheti mwana ywa Sauli na kumwigala uko Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Uko, Abineli niyo amtenda Ishibosheti seuta ywe isi ya Gileyadi na Ashulu na Yezileli na Efulaimu na Benjamini na Izulaeli yose. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishiboshesi nendile ana mihilimo milongo mine eze akonge kuilongoza Izulaeli, naye kalongoza kwa mihilimo midi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:10">Mna awantu idikabila dya Yuda wasigaila kulongozwa ni Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Daudi kalongoza Yuda kwa mihilimo mfungate na nusu, wikazi wakwe nendile wiyuko Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondo mgati mwa Izulaeli na awantu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abineli mwana ywa Neli, hamwenga na masekulu wa Ishibosheti mwana ywa Sauli, wahalawa Mahanaimu waita komzi wa Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yoabu mwana ywa mvyele akwitangwa Seluya na wandima watuhu wa Daudi, nawo wafosa na kudugana na Abineli na awantu endile nawo kwedibwawa dyendile uko Gibeoni. Bunga dimwenga ntendele imwenga ye idibwawa na idituhu ntendele intuhu. <verse eid="2SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Abineli niyo amgamba Yoabu, “Waleke wambwanga watowane kulongozi kwetu!” Yoabu amhitula, “Ni vyedi.” <verse eid="2SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Elo, wabwanga milongo midi na wane niyo walavigwa. Ntendele ye idikabila dya Benjamini na Ishibosheti mwana ywa Sauli, wambwanga mlongo umwenga na waidi na ntendele ya Daudi wambwanga mlongo umwenga na waidi. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Chila yumwenga kamgwila mnkondo ywakwe komtwi, niyo amtunga bamba mhigani ywakwe, ivyo wose waidi wagwa niyo wabanika. Ivyo ahatu aho niyo hetangwa Helikasi Hazulimu kugamba lwazo lwa nkumbizi ya mabamba. Hantu aho heyuko Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Nkondo ye idizuwa idyo yendaga nkulu. Wantu wa Daudi wawahudisa awantu wa Abineli. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Wana watatu wa Seluya, Yoabu na Abishai na Asaheli wendaga aho. Asaheli endaga na nguluko saviya kapala. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Asaheli niyo amwegona Abineli kamwegona. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abineli eze ahituke kunyuma amuwona Asaheli, amuza, “Togola ni weye Asaheli?” Asaheli niyo amhitula, “Heye ni miye.” <verse eid="2SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Abineli niyo amgamba, “Usekunegona, hituka ugwile mbwanga yumwenga na kuguha iviziha.” Mna Asaheli halekile kumtimila. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abineli niyo amgamba Asaheli nkanana ya kaidi, “Leka kuntongela nahukome, ni mbwani hukome? Nna kukoma nanimsinye vivihi mkuluwo Yoabu?” <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Mna Asaheli kalemela. Abineli niyo amtunga guha mwenda chisengelenyuma, idiguha idyo dialaila kungwelo kwa Asaheli. Asaheli niyo agwa hasi, na kubanikila aho. Wantu wose wabwile ahantu aho abanikile Asaheli, niyo wachimala du. <verse eid="2SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Mna Yoabu na Abishai niyo wamtimila Abineli na idizuwa dikengila, wabula kolugulu lwa Ama, lwi ntendele yo ulailo wa zuwa ya Gia, mwe isila ikwita kwe dijangwa dya Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini niyo wechisanya hamwenga kunyuma kwa Abineli, wadamanya fyo dyawo, niyo wachimala kulanga kolugulu. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Aho Abineli niyo amgutila Yoabu, akagamba, “Togola! Nachigombe nkondo mazuwa yose? Togola hukuwona kugamba uhelo wakwe nautende usungu? Togola, nowalagize ini awantu wako waleke kuwatimila Waizulaeli wenyu?” <verse eid="2SA 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yoabu niyo amgamba, “Nelisa kwa Chohile mta ujima, kugamba hegu hwalongile imbuli ino, chindedi wantu wangu nawajendeleza kuwatimila walukolo wawo kubula luvi mtondo.” <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Ivyo Yoabu niyo atowa gunda, wantu wose niyo wachimala, walelka kuwatimila Waizulaeli vituhu, hawatowane vituhu. <verse eid="2SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abineli na awagomba nkondo wakwe wajinka idikolongo dya Alaba ichilo chose. Niyo wadeluka umto wa Yolodani, wajendeleza umsi wose kubula Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Yoabu eze auye kulawa kumtimila Abineli, niyo awaduganya awagomba nkondo wakwe wose, kabunkula kugamba wagomba nkondo mlongo umwenga na chenda wa Daudi hawamuli, hamwenga na Asaheli. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Mna awagomba nkondo wa Daudi nendile wawakoma wagomba nkondo magana matatu na milongo mtandatu wa Abineli kulawa kwedikabila dya Benjamini. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Yoabu na awagomba nkondo wakwe niyo waguha ichimba cha Asaheli, wakuchihamba mwe mbila ya tati yakwe, iyuko Betelehemu. Yoabu na awagomba nkondo wakwe wajenda ichilo chose, eze kuche wabula komzi wa Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Kwendaga na nkondo ya chipindi chitali mgati mwa awantu wakumtimila Sauli, na wadya wakumtimila Daudi. Mna Daudi kajendeleza kuta mnguvu vitendese, mna ikaya ya Sauli ijendeleza kuhwelesa.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana chilume wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Wana chilume wa Daudi welekelwe uko Hebuloni wendaga ni Amnoni mwelekwa ywakwe ywa nkongo, mami yakwe endaga ni Ahinoamu kulawa komzi wa Yezileli, <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Kileabu mwelekwa ywakwe ywa kaidi, mami yakwe endaga Abigaili mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe Nabali kulawa Kalimeli, Abusalomu mwelekwa ywakwe ywa katatu, mami yakwe nendile ni Maaka mchiche ywa Talimai seuta ywa Geshuli, <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Adoniya mwelekwa ywa kane, mami yakwe endaga Hagiti, Shefatiya mwelekwa ywakwe wa shano mami yakwe endaga Abitali, <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />na Iteleamu mwelekwa ywakwe ywa mtandatu, mami yakwe enndaga Egila mkaza Daudi. Wakaza Daudi wamwelekelaga awana awo wose umo wendile uko Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineli alungana na Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Niyo vyatenda, chipindi inkondo ize ijendeleze mgati mo ulukolo lwa Daudi na ludya lwa Sauli, Abineli kahikiliza kwetogeza mwe ikaya ya awantu wa Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Sauli nendile ana chilaga chakwe chimwenga chikwitangwa Lisipa, mchiche ywa Aya. Ivyo, chipindi chimwenga, Ishibosheti niyo amuza Abineli, “Nimbwani ukagona ne ichilaga cha tate?” <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abineli niyo ehiwa vitendese kwemilosi ya Ishibosheti, agamba, “Togola, wafanyanya miye nadaha kumhituka Sauli? Togola, wafanyanya kugamba miye nalusankanila ulukolo lwa Yuda? Kaula miye sinyanyahala kwa lukolo lwa tati yako Sauli, walukolo wakwe na wambuyaze naho sikutendile uhudwe ni Daudi kubula dyelo. Hata ivyo, vino dyelo waniwona kugamba sibalanga kwachausa cha mvyele. <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Chohile nanikome uneva sanijese yose ayo Chohile amwelisizaga Daudi.” <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Chohile amwelisizaga Daudi kugamba nausamize useuta kulawa kolukolo lwa Sauli na kumwinka uyo. Uyo natende seuta ywa Yuda kulawa ntendele ya chenya Dani kubula ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Beli Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ishibosheti hadahile kulonga mbuli, kwaviya endaga akamogoha Abineli. <verse eid="2SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Ivyo, Abineli niyo alagiza wantu kwa Daudi, uko Hebuloni amgamba, “Togola, isi ino nailongozwe ni yuhi? Damanya lagano na miye, miye nahwambize kuitenda Izulaeli yose ilongozwe ni weye.” <verse eid="2SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Daudi niyo amhitula, “Nivyedi, nanidamanye lagano na weye. Mna nnachintu chimwenga hunga kwako, nacho ni chino, hwinati kuniwona, nigaila Mikali, mchiche ywa Sauli, aho ukwizila kuniona.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Ivyo Daudi niyo asigila wantu kwa Ishibosheti, mwana wa Sauli, kugamba, “Nivuziza mkazangu Mikali, nilombile kwa mazoba gana ya Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Ivyo Ishibosheti niyo alagiza wantu wakamguhe Mikali kulawa kwa mgosiwe Palitieli, mwana ywa Laishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Mna Palitieli niyo aita na mkaziwe kuno akaila sila yose kubula Bahulimu. Abineli niyo amgamba, Palitieli “Uya kaya.” Uyo niyo auya. <verse eid="2SA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abineli niyo aita akulafya na wadalahala vilongozi wa Izulaeli, agamba, “Chikale chijinkile namkamlanga Daudi awalongozeni. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Haluse, ilavizeni imbuli ino molumpe kwaviya Chohile kamwelisiza Daudi, ‘Kwa mkono wako weye Daudi mndima ywangu, naniwakombole wantu wangu Izulaeli mwe mikono ya Wafilisiti, na kulawa kwa wankondo wawo wose.’” <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Iviya Abineli niyo alonga na wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini, Abineli niyo aita Hebuloni chani akalonge na Daudi ulosi wose uwoneke ni wedi mwa Waizulaeli, na wantu wose we idikabila dya Benjamini. <verse eid="2SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Abineli akaita kwa Daudi, endaga hamwenga na wantu milongo midi. Daudi niyo awadamanyiza ngasu ya kudya na kunywa Abineli na awantu wose wendile hamwenga naye. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Akaheza Abineli amgamba Daudi, “Haluse miye nahalawa, nite hakwigaile awantu wose wa Izulaeli, weye sekulu ywangu seuta. Naweze wadamanye lagano na weye, chani utende seuta ywawo, weye nowalongoze wose saviya ukunga.” Daudi niyo amlaga Abineli aite zakwe, uyo niyo ahalawa kwa utondowazi.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoabu amkoma Abineli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Ivyo nyumani Yoabu na wantu wasiku wa Daudi niyo wauya kulawa kokuwebunga, wegala vintu vilozize watahile. Mna Abineli nendile hehamwenga na Daudi uko Hebuloni kwaviya Daudi nendile kamlaga aita zakwe, uyo niyo ahalawa kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Yoabu eze auye hamwenga na wagomba nkondo wakwe wose endaga nawo, kagambilwa kugamba Abineli mwana ywa Neli, keza kumkaula seuta Daudi, naye kamleka aite zakwe, naho Abineli kahalawa kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Yoabu nakamwitila seuta na kumgamba, “Haluse kudamanya mbwani? Kaula Abineli nakeza kwako, ni mbwani kumleka aite? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Togola, kuvimanya kugamba Abineli mwana ywa Neli nakeza kukudanta? Nakeza chani amanye inguvu ye idibunga dya awagomba nkondo wako no ulujendo lwe izimbuli zako ukudamanya.” <verse eid="2SA 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Yoabu eze aheze kulonga na Daudi, kalagiza wantu wamwigaile Abineli, nawo niyo wambwila mwe disima dya Sila na kumvuza, mna Daudi hamanyize imbuli iyo. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Abineli eze auye Hebuloni, Yoabu niyo amwitangila kwechumba cha mndani saviya aunga atamwile naye chinyele. Aho Yoabu niyo amtunga guha Abineli mwenda kwaviya Abineli amkomaga Asaheli mlukolo ywa Yoabu, Abineli niyo abanika. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Nyumani Daudi eze eve izimbuli izo niyo agamba, “Miye no useuta wangu hachina lema kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile ne ifile ya Abineli mwana ywa Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Kanto dya ukomi uwo ditende mwa Yoabu na awantu we ikaya yakwe! Lukolo lwa Yoabu mazuwa yose usekuswesa mntu mta unyonje wa kisonono, hegu unyonje wa matana, hegu akujendela makome hegu kukomwa kwa bamba, hegu mta gumbo!” <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Yoabu na mlukolo ywakwe Abishai wamkomaga Abineli kwaviya amkomaga mlukolo ywawo Asaheli chipindi che nkondo uko Gibeoni.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineli ahambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Vikaheza, seuta Daudi niyo amgambila Yoabu na wadya wose wendile hamwenga naye, watatule izisuche zawo, wavale suche za majuniya, chani wamlombolezeze Abineli. Chipindi cho kuhambwa, seuta Daudi nendile akatimila mnyuma mwe idijeneza. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Abineli kahambwa uko Hebuloni, seuta Daudi kalombololeza kwa izwi kulu akatenda hankanda he imbila, iviya wantu watuhu wose wadamanya seivyo. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Seuta Daudi akamlombolezeza Abineli akagamba, “Togola vitenda zeze Abineli kakomwa uge mhezi? <verse eid="2SA 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Mikono yako hainyinyigwe ne iviga vyako havitalizwe mpingu. Kakomwa saviya mntu akomigwe ni wabanasi!” Na wantu wose wajendeleza kumwilila. <verse eid="2SA 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Vikaheza wantu wose niyo waita kwa Daudi wamhembeleza chani adye chochose chipindi cha nomsi. Mna Daudi kelisa akawagamba, “Chohile anikome uneva nanidye chintu chochose kubula chisingi.” <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Wantu wose waziwona izimbuli izo, nayo welelwa, saviya wawagilwe ni chila chintu adamanye seuta. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Ivyo, zuwa diya, Waizulaeli wose wamanya kugamba haitendile fanyanyi ya seuta Daudi kumkoma Abineli mwana ywa Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Seuta Daudi kawagambila wandima wakwe, “Togolani hammanyize kugamba dyelo chilongozi mkulu kabanika mweisi ya Izulaeli? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Hata hegu mnijela mavuta chani nitende seuta, mna dyelo miye siholola. Wano wana wa Seluya ni wabanasi vitendese. Chohile na awakantile wano kuligana no ubanasi wawo.”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti akomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ishibosheti mwana ywa Sauli eze eve kugamba Abineli kabanika uko Hebuloni, niyo afa chevu, na wantu wose wa Izulaeli wasusuhala. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Ishibosheti mwanawe dya Sauli endaga na wantu waidi vilongozi wa mabunga ya wata kwebunga, yumwenga naketangwa Baana, ywa kaidi naketangwa Lekabu. Awo wendaga wana wa Limoni, mntu ywa kabila dya Benjamini kulawa komzi wa Beloti. Kwaviya Beloti wendaga ugoli wa kabila dya Benjamini. <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />Wekazi wa Beloti wasumkila Gitaimu, naho wekala uko kubula vino dyelo.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Yonasani mwana ywa Sauli endaga na mwana aholomale iviga akwitangwa Mefibosheti. Mefibosheti endaga na mihilimo mishano umo Sauli na Yonasani wakakomwa. Elo, weze weve imbuli ye ifile ize ibule komzi wa Yezileeli, yudya mndele akumlela niyo amguha aguluka naye, mna umo akasunguza kuguluka mwana uyo niyo agwa, vyamleka aholomala vitendese. <verse eid="2SA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Lekabu na Baana wana wa Limoni kulawa komzi wa Beloti, waitaga kunyumba kwa Ishibosheti. Wabula uko chipindi cha msi edehuze kwenyumbakwe. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Wengila kunyumba, saviya waunga waguhe ngano, wambwila Mefibosheti kagona molusazi lwakwe kwechumba chakwe cho kugona, niyo wamtunga guha dya mwenda wamkoma. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Weze wamkome, walukolo awo waidi niyo wamkanta isingo waguha umtwi wasumka nawo. Wajinkila kwesila ya Alaba watamba chilo chijima. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Niyo wamwigaila Daudi umtwi wa Ishibosheti uko Hebuloni. Wamgamba seuta Daudi, “Kaula, uno nu mtwi wa Ishibosheti, mwana ywa Sauli, mwihi ywako, nakaunga akukome. Zumbe Chohile dyelo kakulihiziza chikoda mwa Sauli na welekwa wakwe.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Mna Daudi niyo awahitula Lekabu na Baana mlukolo ywakwe wana wa Limoni mtu ywa Beloti, awagamba, “Nelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta ujima, uyo akombole wikazi wangu kulawa mwe chila nkunto. <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />Yudya mntu ezile kunigagambila, Sauli kakomwa, akafanyanya kugamba kanigaila mbuli yedi, simgwila niyo namkoma uko Sikilagi, nayo amaliho nimwinkile kwa mbuli zakwe anigaile! <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Togolani, mntu mwihi akakoma mntu mkanuni akatenda mo lusazi kwenyumbakwe, haviwagile miye kumlihiza kwachausa cha kumkoma umntu uyo?” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Daudi niyo awalagiza wagomba nkondo wakwe, wawakome Lekabu na Baana. Niyo wawakanta imikono ne iviga vyawo. Wakaheza niyo wawanyulika mwe mti hampezo he bwawa uko Hebuloni. Mna umtwi wa Ishibosheti wauguha na kuuhamba mwembila ya Abineli uko Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Daudi atendwa seuta ywa amakabila yose ya Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Wantu wa amakabila yose ya Izulaeli wambasaga Daudi uko Hebuloni, wamgamba, “Kaula, suwe na weye lukolo ni lumwe. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Aho nkongo, Sauli endaga seuta ywetu, ni weye wendile uwalongoze Waizulaeli mwe nkondo, na Chohile akugambilaga, ‘Notende mdimi ywa awantu wangu Izulaeli naho notende chilongozi ywa Izulaeli.’” <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Ivyo, vilongozi wose wa Izulaeli niyo wambasa seuta Daudi uko Hebuloni, niyo adamanya lagano nawo kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, wakaheza niyo wamhaka mavuta atende seuta ywa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Daudi endaga na mihilimo milongo mitatu aho akongaga kulongoza, kalongoza kwa mihilimo milongo mine. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Uko Hebuloni, kalongoza wantu wa Yuda kwa mihilimo mfungate na myezi mtandatu, na uko Yelusalemu kalongoza wantu wa Izulaeli hamwenga na Yuda kwa mihilimo milongo mitatu na ntatu.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Nyumani seuta na wantu wakwe niyo waita Yelusalemu kuwebunga Wayebusi wendaga wekazi we isi iyo. Mna Wayebusi niyo wamgamba Daudi “Howingile muno mo mzi kwaviya hata matuntu na waholomale wadaha kukubalaza.” Wamgambila ivyo kwaviya nawakafanyanya kugamba Daudi hadahe kwingila mo mzi uwo. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Mna seuta Daudi kataha ingome ya Sayuni, kugamba mzi wa Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Zuwa idyo, Daudi kagamba, “Mntu yoyose akunga awatowe Wayebusi ajinkille komfilimbi wa amazi chani awebunge waholomale na matuntu wadya umoyo wangu ukuwehiwa.” Nivyo vikuleka wantu wagamba, “Matuntu na waholomale hawengile kwenyumba ya Zumbe.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Daudi kekala kwe ngome iyo, na umzi niyo awitanga, “Mzi wa Daudi.” Daudi azengaga akazunguluka umzi, kakongela Milo kuhinga mndani. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Daudi niyo ajendeleza kutenda na nguvu vitendese kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile mta nguvu, endaga hamwenga naye. <verse eid="2SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Vikaheza Hilamu seuta ywa Tilo kalagiza walosi wa Daudi, iviya kamwigaila miti ya mielezi, wakusongola na wazesi awo wamzengele Daudi zumba dya chiseuta. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo abunkula kugamba Chohile kamtogeza vileke atende seuta ywa Izulaeli, na kugamba kachumilwa mo useuta wakwe kwachausa cha wantu wakwe wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Daudi kaguha vilaga na wavyele walozize uko ko mzi wa Yelusalemu ukaleka wadya endile nawo uko Hebuloni. Awo, niyo wamwelekela wana walozize wa chilume na wachiche. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Amazina ya wana wa chilume wa Daudi elekelwe na awavyele wakwe uko Yelusalemu, Shamuwa na Shobabu na Nasani na Solomoni, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />na Ibuhali na Elishuwa na Nefegi na Yafiya, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />na Elishama na Eliyada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi awahuda Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1Mihilimo 14:8-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Wafilisiti weze weve kugamba Daudi kahakwa mavuta atenda seuta ywa Izulaeli, wagomba nkondo wose wa Wafilisiti wafosa waita wakumlonda, mna Daudi eze eve imbuli iyo, vyaleka engila mwe ngome. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Wafilisiti wabula na kutandama mwe idibwandasi dya Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo amuza Chohile, “Togola, nite hawebunge Wafilisiti? Togola, noninke uhuda mwawo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Chohile niyo amhitula Daudi, “Hita, kwaviya chindedi nahwinke uhuda mwa Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="2SA 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Elo, Daudi niyo aita abula Baali Pelasimu, uko niyo awahuda Wafilisiti. Daudi niyo agamba, “Zumbe Chohile kajinka mgatigati mwa awankondo wangu saviya mazi yabohole yakuguluka.” Ivyo hantu aho hetangwa Baali Pelasimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Wafilisiti wasa amatukulu yawo ne imilungu yawo aho, Daudi na awagomba nkondo wakwe niyo waviguha.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Wafilisiti niyo wakwela nkanana ya kaidi wazagala mweidibwandasi dya Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Daudi eze amlombeze Zumbe Chohile ulangilizi, Chohile niyo amgamba, “Usekuwebunga kulawa hano wili, mna zunguluka na kuwebunga kulawa ndendele ikusinyana ne imiti ye imifolosadi. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Aho namwivile sindo za wagomba nkondo kwevinenengwe vye imifolosadi iyo, aho kwenke moyo nanitende silaila chani hulongoile kuwatowa wagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Daudi kadamanya saviya agambilwe ni Zumbe Chohile, niyo awatowa Wafilisiti kulawa Geba kubula Gezeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Shanduku dye Idilagano dyegalwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Daudi niyo awachisanya vituhu wagomba nkondo wakankalu wa Izulaeli, uwazwa wawo ni elufu magana matatu. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Daudi niyo ahalawa hamwenga na awantu wakwe wose endaga nawo kulawa Baala Yuda, waita wakudiguha idishanduku dye idilagano dikwitangwa kwa zina dyakwe, heye, zina dya Zumbe Chohile ywa wagomba nkondo akwikala mlanga mwe ngubiko ye idishanduku dye idilagano dyo uzumbe hagati he vyumbe vina mawawa vikwitangwa makelubi. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Ivyo, niyo wadika idisanduku dya Chohile mlanga mwe lingisha hya, wadilavya mwe inyumba ya Abinadabu yendile hantu henukile, wadinula mlanga mwe lingisha hya dikubuluzwa ni ng'ombe. Uza na Ahiyo wana wa Abinadabu nawo nawakendesha idilingisha idyo, <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />lingisha idyo dikatenda ne idishanduku dya Chohile, Ahio akatenda kulongozi. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Daudi na awantu wose wa Izulaeli, nendile wakachema nchemo na kuvina kwa nguvu zawo zose, kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. Watowa vimpandwa vya kuchemela vidamanywe kwa visindamgunda na magunda na mbuji na malimba na vilangu. <verse eid="2SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Weze wabule kwechiwasa cho kuhetela uhule cha Nakomi, Uza niyo achulusa umkono wakwe na kuditoza idishanduku dya Chohile kwaviya ziya izing'ombe zekowadika. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Aho maya ya Chohile niyo yamwimukila Uza. Chohile niyo amkomela ahadya. Uza kabanikila ahadya hankanda he idisanduku dya Chohile. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Daudi niyo ehiwa kwaviya Chohile kamkantila uza kwa maya. Ivyo, hantu hadya niyo hetangwa Pelesi Uza kubula vino dyelo. <verse eid="2SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Daudi niyo amogoha Zumbe zuwa diya, niyo agamba, “Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile nadize kwangu vivihi?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Ivyo, Daudi kaleka kudigala idisanduku dya Zumbe Chohile komzi wakwe wa Yelusalemu, hantu hakwe kadigala kwenyumba ya Obedi Edomu mwikazi ywo umzi wa Gati. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Shanduku dya Zumbe Chohile dikala myezi mitatu kwenyumba ya Obedi Edomu mwikazi ywo umzi wa Gati, Zumbe Chohile niyo amjimbika Obedi Edomu, na awantu we ikaya yakwe yose.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Seuta Daudi eze eve kugamba Chohile kawajimbika awantu we ikaya ya Obedi Edomu ne ivintu vyose endile navyo kwachausa cha idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile, niyo aita akudiguha idisanduku dye idilagano kulawa kwenyumba ya Obedi Edomu, kadigala komzi wa Daudi kwa chinyemi. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Wantu wadya wadinule idisanduku dya Zumbe Chohile chila wakatoa nkacho mtandatu, Daudi alavya ntambiko, njeku na ndama imwenga idamane. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Daudi niyo avina kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile kwa nguvu zakwe zose, Daudi nendile kavala kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa kamlavya ntambiko. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Ivyo, Daudi na awantu wose wa Izulaeli wadikweza idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile kubula komzi wa Daudi kwa chinyemi na izwi kulu dya magunda. <verse eid="2SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Shanduku dya Zumbe Chohile umo dyendile dikengila momzi wa Daudi, Mikali mchiche ywa Sauli kasungila kwe didilisha niyo amwona seuta Daudi akapilika na kuvina kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, ivyo, niyo amhufya mo moyo wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Niyo wadingiza idisanduku dya Zumbe Chohile mndani mwe idihema dizengigwe ni Daudi na kudika ahantu hakwe hokwikiya. Daudi kalavya ntambiko za kutikimya na ntambiko za utondowazi kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Daudi eze ajike kulavya ntambiko zo kutikimya na utondowazi, niyo awajimbika wantu kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile mta udahi wose. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Iviya, awapangila wantu wose, bunga dyose dya Waizulaeli, wagosi na wavyele, chila yumwenga, mgate, unde dya nyama na mkate wa zabibu. Vikaheza, wantu wose niyo wahalawa, chila mntu auya kwekaya yakwe. <verse eid="2SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Daudi eze auye kwekaya yakwe chani awajimbike awantu we ikaya yakwe, Mikali, mchiche ywa Sauli, niyo amsingila, akagamba, “Chilozo cha seuta ywa Izulaeli dyelo hetunyize, vitenda vivihi ejele soni kwa kwikala mwazi kulongozi kwa awandima wakwe wa chilume na wachiche saviya mchilalu akuhambula izisuche zakwe kulongozi kwa wantu hena soni!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Daudi niyo amgamba Mikali, “Nendile nikulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile yudya anisagule miye akamleka tati yako na wantu we ikaya yakwe, chani anisagule nitende mkulu ywa Izulaeli, wantu wakwe Zumbe Chohile, ivyo miye nanivine du kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Nanijendeleze kunyanyahala kujinka haluse. Weye noniwone ni mchilalu, mna awo awandima we chiche ulongile nawanitunye.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Ivyo, Mikali mchiche ywa Sauli hatendile na mwana kubula kubanika kwakwe.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Nasani kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1Mihilimo 17:1-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Umo seuta Daudi endaga akekala mwedizumba dye chiseuta, Zumbe Chohile kamdahiza atende na utondowazi na awankondo wakwe chila ntendele, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />seuta Daudi niyo amgamba muoni Nasani, “Hake kaula, miye nekala mwe mwezumba dya chiseuta dizengigwe kwa miti ya mihugwe, mna idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile dyekala mwe hema.” <verse eid="2SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Nasani niyo amgamba seuta, “Hita ukadamanye chochose ukufanyanya mo moyo wako, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile ehamwenga na weye.” <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Mna ichilo icho Zumbe Chohile niyo amgambila Nasani, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Hita ukamgambile mndima ywangu Daudi, ‘Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, togola, weye nonizengele nyumba chani nikale? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Kukongela zuwa diya niwalavize Waizulaeli mweisi ya Misili kubula vino dyelo sikale mwe nyumba. Najendaga chila hantu hatenda nekala mwe hema. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Chila hantu nitile na Waizulaeli simgambile mntu yoyose ywa Izulaeli nisagule awadime awantu wa Izulaeli, kwambwani hunizengele nyumba ya mihugwe?’” <verse eid="2SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />Ivyo haluse, mgambile mndima ywangu Daudi, Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose agamba vino, “Sikulavya mwe ludimo kudya wendile ukadima ngoto, chani uwalongoze awantu wangu wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Kukongela ichipindi icho nendile nihamwenga na weye chila hantu witile siwabalanga wehi wako kulongozi kwako. Nahutende utoge saviya wakulu watuhu mweisi. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Naho naniwasaguile wantu wangu wa Izulaeli hantu hakwikala chani wekale hantu hawo wenye vileke wasekutubwadiswa vituhu. Naho wantu manyakwili wakujesa chinguvu hawawasulumize vituhu saviya nkongo, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />kukongela niwasagule walamuzi walongoze awantu wangu wa Izulaeli. Ukaleka ayo, miye Zumbe Chohile nakugambila nahudime kulawana na wehi wako wose na kukwinka vyeleko. Miye nahuzengele nyumba. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Aho ukunga ubanikile na kuhambwa na kwelunga hamwenga na wababa zako, nanimtende yumwenga ywa wanawo atende seuta, miye nami naniutende useuta wakwe utende na nguvu. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Uyo nuyo akunga azenge nyumba kwachausa changu na uuseuta wakwe naujendeleze kale na kale. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Miye nanitende tati yakwe, naye natende mwanangu. Akadamanya yehiye, nanimfunde saviya wantu wakuwafunda wana wawo kwa nkome. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Mna sanimusize ungi wangu saviya niusize kwa Sauli, uyo endile seuta weye hwinati. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Nanikombaganye kugamba yumwenga ywa awelekwa wako natende seuta kale na kale. Chigoda chako cho useuta nachitende na nguvu.”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Nasani niyo amgambila Daudi chila chintu awone mwe izisozi izo alagiswe ni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi amtogola Chohile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1Mihilimo 17:16-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Vikaheza seuta Daudi niyo engila kunyumba na kwikala kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile alombeza, “Weye Zumbe Chohile, miye ni yuhi, na awantu we ikaya yangu ni chintu chani vikuleka waninula kubula hano nili dyelo! <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Mbuli ino nendile ni ndodo kulongozi kwako. Zumbe Chohile, ukaleka ayo kulonga mbuli nkulu zikwiza mwa awantu we ikaya yangu, kumbe vino nivyo ukuwatendela wantu! Weye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Hugambile mbwani, miye Daudi mndima ywako? Kwaviya weye Zumbe Chohile kunimanya! <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Kwachausa che indagano yako no ungi wako, kudamanya mbuli ino nkulu, chani unihi nye miye mndima ywako. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Kulawana na mbuli chivile, weye Zumbe Chohile ni weye umkulu, hahana akuligana na weye, naho hahana Chohile mtuhu mna weye. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Naho ni wantu wahi mweisi wakudaha kuliganywa na awantu wako wa Izulaeli, wadya ukombole kulawa Misili kwachausa chako chani watende wantu wako mwenye na kudamanya mbuli nkulu na maula yakutisa kwa kuwabalaza awantu we izisi ntuhu ne imilungu yawo kulongozi kwa awantu wako? <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Kuwajela nguvu awantu wako wa Izulaeli watende wantu wako kale na kale, weye Zumbe Chohile kutenda Chohile ywawo. <verse eid="2SA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />Ivyo haluse, weye Zumbe Chohile, chintiza imbuli idya ulongile mwa miye mndima ywako, na mbuli za wantu we ikaya yangu saviya ulongile. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Zina dyako ditunywe kale na kale, na wantu wagambe, ‘Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu zose nuyo Chohile mwe Izulaeli.’ Na awantu we ikaya yangu miye mndima ywako, Daudi, nawatende watoga kulongozi kwako. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Kwaviya weye Zumbe Chohile Mta Nguvu Zose, Chohile ywa Izulaeli kunigubuila miye, mndima ywako, ukagamba, ‘Nahuzengele nyumba.’ Nivyo vikuleka sina nkama ya kulombeza idilombezo dino kulongozi kwako, miye mndima ywako. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />Haluse, weye Zumbe Chohile weye ni weye Chohile, na ulosi wako ni wa chindedi, weye kunikiya ndagano miye mndima ywako, imbuli ino yedi, <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />elo, haluse nalombeza, ikaya yangu miye mndima ywako ikalise mazuwa yose kulongozi kwako, kwaviya weye, nivyo ulongile, naho kwa ujimbiko wako nyumba yangu naijimbikwe kale na kale.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ahuda nkondo zilozize</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1Mihilimo 18:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Mbuli izo zize ziheze, Daudi niyo awatowa na kuwahuda Wafilisiti. Niyo ataha umzi wa Metagi Ama kulawa mwa Wafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Iviya Daudi kawahuda Wamoabu. Kawagoneza nchanjale hasi na kuwahima kwa luzigi. Chila akahima utali we isigi iyo nkanana mbili bunga dya awantu awo Daudi kalagiza wakomwe, mna idibunga dihimigwe lumwenga nkanana ya katatu kalagiza wasekumwa. Wamoabu niyo watenda wandima wa Daudi, wamliha kodi. <verse eid="2SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Iviya, Daudi niyo amtowa Hadadezeli mwana ywa Lehobu seuta ywa Soba. Daudi kahuda uhuda uwo umo akatenda emwesila akaita kuvuza ahantu homto wa Eufulate hatende mo ulongozi wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Daudi niyo amhoka wakwela falasi elufu imwenga na magana mfungate na wagomba nkondo wakujenda lwa viga elufu milongo midi, Daudi niyo akanta izinyuje ze izifalasi zose ze imyutuka, mna niyo asigaza falasi za myutuka gana dimwenga. <verse eid="2SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Waalamu wa Damesiki weze waite kumwambiza Hadadezeli, seuta ywa Soba, Daudi niyo awebunga na kuwakoma wantu elufu milongo midi na magana milongo midi. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Vikaheza Daudi nakaika nkambi za nkondo mo umzi wa Waalamu wa Damasiki. Ivyo, Waalamu watenda wandima wakwe niyo watenda wamliha kodi. Chohile kamwinka Daudi uhuda kokose aitile. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Daudi kataha nchinga za zahabu wenule wagomba nkondo wa Hadadezeli na kuzigala Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Iviya, kataha Shaba zilozese kulawa mwe imizi ya Beta na Belotai, yendile mizi ya Hadadezeli. <verse eid="2SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Umo seuta Toi ywa Hamati, eze eve kugamba Daudi kawahuda awagomba nkondo wose wa Hadadezeli, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />kamsigila mwanawe Yolamu kwa seuta Daudi kumwigaila ndamsa na ntunyo kwaviya katowana na Hadadezeli na kumhuda. Kwaviya Hadadezeli katowana na Toi nkanana zilozize. Yolamu kamwigaila Daudi majeleko ya via vya chumbu na zahabu na shaba. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Majeleko ayo, hamwenga na chumbu na zahabu seuta Daudi endaga kazitaha kwa wantu we izisi zose ahudile, niyo azisenta kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />Izisi ahudaga ni Edomu na Moabu na Amoni na Filisitiya na Amaleki hamwenga ne ivintu atahile kulawa kwa seuta Hadadezeli, mwana ywa Lehobu seuta ywa Soba. <verse eid="2SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Daudi niyo ajenyeza kumanyikisa kwakwe. Umo akauya akalaila kumhuda Hadadezeli, kawakoma Waedomu elufu mlongo na magana milongo mnane, mwe idibwandasi dyo munyu. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Niyo aika lago dya kugombela nkondo mwe Edomu yose. Na Waedomu wose wa uko niyo watenda wandima wakwe. Zumbe Chohile kamwinka Daudi uhuda chila hantu aitile. <verse eid="2SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Ivyo, Daudi kalongoza Izulaeli yose, kakombaganya kugamba wantu wakwe wose wadamanyizwa vikuwagila. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yoabu mwana wa Seluya, endaga sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo. Yehoshafati mwana ywa Ahiludi, endaga mwandika mbuli zikulaila chani zisekujalwa. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Sadoki mwana ywa Ahitubu na Ahimeleki mwana ywa Abiatali nawo wendile walavyantambiko, Selaya endaga sekulu mta kuwandika. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya mwana ywa Yehoyada endaga chilongozi ywa wamizi wa seuta Daudi mwenye wakwitangwa Wakeleti na Wapeleti, awana wa Daudi niyo watenda walavyantambiko.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Zuwa dimwenga, Daudi auzaga, “Togolani, hana mntu yoyose asigale mwe ikaya ya Sauli? Hegu eyuko, nahaunga nimdamanyi yedi kwachausa cha Yonasani.” <verse eid="2SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Kwendaga na mndima yumwenga mwe ikaya ya Sauli, zina dyakwe naketangwa Siba. Siba niyo etangwa aite kwa Daudi. Seuta Daudi niyo amuza, “Togola, weye ni weye Siba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Siba niyo amhitula, “Heye ni miye mndima ywako.” <verse eid="2SA 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Seuta niyo amuza, “Togola, hahana mntu yoyose asigaile mwa awantu we ikaya ya Sauli? Hegu eyuko naunga nimdamanyize wedi wa Chohile.” Siba niyo amhitula seuta, “Eyuko mwanawe dya Yonasani, kaholomala iviga.” <verse eid="2SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Seuta niyo amuza, “Ekuhi?” Siba niyo amhitula, “Ekukaya kwa Makili mwana ywa Amieli uko Lo Debali.” <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Ivyo, seuta Daudi niyo alagiza wantu waite wakamguhe kulawa kwenyumba ya Makili mwana ywa Amieli uko Lo Debali. <verse eid="2SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Ivyo, Mefibosheti mwana ywa Yonasani, mwezukulu ywa Sauli niyo aita kwa seuta Daudi, eze abule enama kumtunya seuta Daudi. Daudi niyo amwitanga, “Mefibosheti.” Mefibosheti niyo amwitika, “Sekulu, miye mndima ywako nihano.” <verse eid="2SA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Daudi niyo amgamba, “Usekogoha. Miye nahudamanyize wedi kwachausa cha tati yako Yonasani. Idya isanga yose yendile ya babako Sauli nahuvuzize. Weye, mazuwa yose nodye hemeza yangu.” <verse eid="2SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefibosheti niyo enama kulongozi kwa Daudi amgamba, “Miye ni saviya kuli difile, ni mbwani watumbwazika savino mwangu?” <verse eid="2SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Vikaheza, seuta Daudi niyo amwitanga Siba mndima ywa Sauli, amgamba, “Udya ugoli wose wendile wa Sauli, na awantu we ikaya yakwe simwinka mwezukulu ywa sekulu ywako. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Weye na wanawo, na awandima wako namtende walimi wa Mefibosheti na kumwigaila ulozo chani mwezukulu ywa sekulu ywako atende na nkande mazuwa yose. Mna uyo nadye he meza yangu.” Chipindi icho, Siba endaga na wana wa chilume mlongo umwenga na washano na wandima milongo midi. <verse eid="2SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Vikaheza, Siba niyo amgamba seuta, “Miye mndima ywako, nanidamanye yose kuligana ne dilagizo dyako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:11">Ivyo, Mefibosheti niyo atenda enkigwa nkande yakwe he meza ya Daudi, saviya yumwe ywa wana wa seuta. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Uyo Mefibosheti endaga na mwana chilume, zina dyakwe naketangwa Mika. Wantu wose we ikaya ya Siba niyo watenda wandima wa Mefibosheti. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Ivyo, Mefibosheti aholomale iviga vyakwe vyose niyo ekala komzi wa Yelusalemu na kudya nkande hemeza ya seuta mazuwa yose.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Daudi awahuda Waamoli na Waashulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1Mihilimo 19:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Yeze yeheze ayo, seuta Nahasi ywa Waamoli niyo abanika, mwanawe etangwe Hanuni niyo atenda seuta hantu ha tati yakwe. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Seuta Daudi niyo agamba, “Nanimdamanyize wedi Hanuni, mwana ywa Nahashi saviya tati yakwe anidamanyize.” Ivyo, Daudi niyo asigila walosi wamwigaile ndamsa za mbukuzi. Walosi awo wa Daudi weze wabule mweisi ya Waamoli, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />wakulu wa Waamoli wamgambila sekulu ywawo, Hanuni, “Togola, wafanyanya kugamba Daudi kwa kujeseza wantu wakukuhongeza amtunya tati yako? Togola, Daudi hawasigile awantu wano kwako chani wazuze na kuupelemba umzi vikaheza wautahe?” <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Ivyo, Hanuni niyo awagwila awalosi awo wa Daudi na kuwawegula chila yumwenga nusu ye izindevu zakwe, niyo atatula izisuche zawo mgatigati kubula mwa amatako, ukajika niyo awaleka waite zawo. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Wawona soni vitendese kuya kaya. Daudi eze eve ivyo vilaile niyo asigila wantu wakadugane nawo kwaviya wajelwa soni. Seuta kawagamba, “Ikalani mo umzi wa Yeliko, kubula izindevu zenyu zihota vituhu, mkaheza uyani kaya.” <verse eid="2SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Waamoli weze wawone wamwihiza Daudi, niyo wakodi wagomba nkondo Waalamu elufu milongo midi wakujenda lwa viga kulawa Beti Lehobu na Soba na wagomba nkondo elufu imwenga na milongo midi kulawa Tobu na seuta Maaka akatenda na wagomba nkondo elufu imwenga. <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Daudi eze eve imbuli iyo, niyo amsigila Yoabu aite na wagomba nkondo wose wakankalu. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Waamoni niyo wafosa, wemalanya kwe inchili yo umzi wa Laba, umzi wawo umkulu, Waalamu nawo kulawa Soba na Lehobu na wantu kulawa Tobu na Maaka watandama kwenyika. <verse eid="2SA 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yoabu eze awone kulongoziz kwakwe na kunyuma wagomba nkondo wakwe webungwa kulongozi na kunyuma, niyo asagula wagomba nkondo wasiku wa Waizulaeli wakankalu vitendese awaika watowane na Waalamu. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Wadya wagomba nkondo awatuhu wasigale kawaika walongozwe ni mlukolo ywakwe Abishai, awaika watowane na Waamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yoabu niyo amgamba Abishai, “Hegu Waalamu wanihuma nguvu nonambize, mna hegu Waamoli wakuhuma nguvu nanize hwambize. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Mna usekufa chevu! Chitowane chigosi kwachausa cha awantu wetu, na kwachausa che imizi ya Chohile ywetu, Zumbe Chohile nachitendele diya akuwona ni dyedi kwakwe.” <verse eid="2SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Ivyo, Yoabu na awantu wakwe niyo wawabasa Waalamu vileke wagombe nkondo nawo, Waalamu niyo wasumka. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Waamoni weze wawone kugamba Waalamu wasumka, iviya nawo niyo wamsumka Abishai wengila ko mzi. Yoabu niyo aleka kutowana na Waamoni, auya Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Mna Waalamu weze wawone kugamba wahundwa ni Waizulaeli, niyo wechisanya hamwenga. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Hadadezeli niyo alagiza Waalamu wendaga kwentendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Eufulate wegalwe, uko Helamu wakalongozwa ni Shobaki sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo wa Hadadezeli. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Daudi eze agambilwe, niyo awaduganya wagomba nkondo wose wa Waizulaeli, adeluka umto wa Yolodani aita kubula Helamu. Waalamu niyo watandama wagombe nkondo na Daudi. Nkondo niyo yakonga. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Mna Waalamu niyo wasumka kulongozi kwa Waizulaeli, Daudi niyo akoma Waalamu magana mfungate wakwendesha malingisha ya kugombela nkondo, wakwela falasi elufu magana milongo mine. Iviya kamlumiza Shobaki sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo wawo, niyo abanikila aho. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Vikaheza, maseuta wose wendile wandima wa Hadadeli weze wewone kugamba wahudwa ni Waizulaeli, niyo wadamanya wivano na Waizulaeli, awo niyo watenda watumwa wa Waizulaeli. Ivyo Waalamu niyo wagoha kuwambiza vituhu Waamoni.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Batisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Mwenkongelo yo mhilimo umhya, umo maseuta wakaita kwe nkondo, Daudi nakamwigala Yoabu, na wandima wakwe hamwenga naye, na Waizulaeli wose, niyo wawakoma wana wa Waamoni, na kutaha umzi wa Laba. Mna Daudi nakasigala Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Zuwa dimwenga chisingi, Daudi niyo enuka mo lusazi, ajenda mlanga mwe golofa yakwe ye chiseuta, eze atende mlanga mwe golofa niyo awona mvyele akuhaka, mvyele uyo nanimtana vidala. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Daudi niyo asigila mntu akauze mvyele uyo ni yuhi. Mntu uyo niyo amgamba Daudi, “Mvyele uyo ni Batisheba mchiche ywa Eliyabu, naho ni mkaza Uliya ywa kabila dya Wahiti.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Ivyo, Daudi kasigila wantu wamwigale. Batisheba niyo aita kwa Daudi, Daudi niyo agona naye, mvyele uyo endaga kalawa mo kwekukiza amazuwa yakwe yeze yajinke, ukajika niyo auya kunyumba kwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Mvyele yudya niyo atenda msoka, ivyo amwigaila ulosi Daudi kugamba ana usoka wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo amwigaila ulosi Yoabu, “Msigile Uliya, Mhiti kwangu.” Yoabu niyo amsigila Uliya kwa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Uliya eze abule kwa Daudi, Daudi niyo amuza mbuli za Yoabu na wantu wose, ne nkondo. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Daudi niyo amgamba Uliya, “Uya kukaya kwako ukande kuhumula hadodo.” Uliya niyo afosa kunyumba kwa seuta, ahadya seuta niyo amwigaila majeleko. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Mna Uliya haitile kwekaya yakwe, kagona hamwenga na awandima wose wa seuta ywakwe mwe inchili ye idizumba dya seuta. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Wantu niyo wamgambila Daudi kugamba, Uliya hawiye kukaya kwakwe, Daudi niyo amuza Uliya, “Weye kulawa ntambo, ni mbwani huwiye kukaya kwako?” <verse eid="2SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Uliya niyo amhitula Daudi, “Shanduku dye dilagano, hamwenga na wagomba nkondo wose wa Izulaeli na Yuda wekigwa kwe wakumbi kwe nkondo. Sekulu ywangu Yoabu na awandima wakwe wose waika nkambi kumbago, togola ni vyedi miye nuye kukaya hagone na kunywa na kugona na mkazangu? Saviya ukwikala ne loho yako ikwikala sanidamanye chintu seicho.” <verse eid="2SA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Vikaheza, Daudi niyo amgamba Uliya, “Haluse, ikala hano dyelo, luvi nahuleke uye.” Uliya niyo asigala komzi wa Yelusalemu zuwa idyo. Zuwa ditimile, <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Daudi niyo amgoneka Uliya kudya na kunywa uko kwakwe, kamtenda Uliya akolwe. Mna ichilo icho Uliya hawiye kwekaya yakwe, mna kagona mwe chilago chimwenga na awandima wa seuta ywakwe. <verse eid="2SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Mtondo wakwe, Daudi kamwandikila Yoabu baluwa niyo amwinka Uliya amwigaile Yoabu.<verse eid="2SA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Mwe baluwa iyo, kawandika kugamba, “Mwike Uliya kulongozi kwa wantu he nkondo nkulu, ukajika halaweni, mwaseni chani akomwe.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Ivyo, Yoabu umo akautandama umzi niyo amwika Uliya hantu hana wankondo wakankalu vitendese. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Wagomba nkondo wa awankondo wo umzi uwo niyo wafosa, watowana na Yoabu, wagomba nkondo wasiku we idibunga dya Daudi na Uliya, ywe idikabila dya Wahiti niyo wakomwa. <verse eid="2SA 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Vikaheza, Yoabu niyo egala ulosi kwa Daudi amgambila mbuli zose ze nkondo. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Yoabu niyo amlagiza uyo mndima kugamba, “Ukaheza kumgambila seuta izimbuli zose ze nkondo, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />anehiwa na kukuza, ‘Ni mbwani mkaita hajihi no umzi umo mkagomba nkondo? Togola! Hamwamanyize kugamba nawakunte mifulo kulawa kweviwambaza vyo umzi wawo? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Ni yuhi amkomile Abimeleki, mwana ywa Yelubesheti? Gamba endaga ni mvyele yumwenga komzi wa Tebesi aduile yuwe dya kusagila kulawa kwechiwambaza nadyo niyo dyamkoma Abimeleki? Elo, kwambwani mkaita hajihi ne ichiwambaza?’ Ivyo weye nomgambe vino, ‘Hata mndima ywako Uliya ywe idikabila dya Wahiti naye kakomwa.’” <verse eid="2SA 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Yudya mntu kaita kwa Daudi na kumgambila yose alagizwe ni Yoabu alonge. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Yudya Mntu niyo amgambila Daudi, “Wankondo wetu wachihuma nguvu, niyo wafosa kuse kwemizi na kuchebunga kumbago. Mna suwe chiwavuza kubula mwe nchili yo mzi. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Wachikuntila mifulo suwe awandima wako kulawa kwechiwambaza. Wandima wako wasiku wakomwa. Hata mndima ywako Uliya ywe idikabila dya Wahiti, naye kakomwa.” <verse eid="2SA 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Daudi niyo amgamba yudya mntu, “Kamgambe vino Yoabu, ‘Mbuli iyo isekukwehela kwaviya nkondo haina meso, nkondo yakoma mntu yoyose. Mna kwemalanye wetumbe ugombe nkondo momzi kubula ubalange umzi uwo.’ Nivyo nomjele moyo Yoabu.” <verse eid="2SA 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Batisheba mkaza Uliya eze eve kugamba mgosiwe Uliya kakomwa, niyo amlombolezeza. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Kulomboleza uko kwize kuheze, Daudi niyo asigila mntu aite akamguhe Batisheba amwigaile kunyumba kwakwe, niyo amtenda mkaziwe, niyo amwelekela mwana ywa chilume. Mna mbuli idya adamanye Daudi imwihiza Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Nasani amkwahila Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Ivyo, Chohile niyo amlagiza muoni Nasani kwa Daudi. Nasani niyo ambasa Daudi, amgamba, “Kwendaga na wantu waidi mwe mzi umwenga, yumwenga endaga mgoli no mtuhu endaga mchiwa. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Yudya mgoli endaga na ngoto na ng'ombe zilozize. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Mna yudya mchiwa nendile hena chintu, ukaleka mwate umwenga aguile. Kaidima kukaya kwakwe hamwenga na wanawe niyo yakula. Inkande iyo nakadya niyo endile akailisa ingoto iyo na kuywela mwechikombe chakwe naho nendile akaisumula mwechifuwa. Mwate uwo wendaga saviya mchiche kwa yudya mntu mchiwa. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Zuwa dimwenga, yudya mgoli nakezilwa ni mjeni. Ivyo, mgoli yudya haungile kuguha imwenga mwe izingoto zakwe hegu ng'ombe zakwe, amchinjize umjeni ywakwe, mna kaita kakumhoka yudya mchiwa mwana ngoto ywakwe, niyo amchinjiza umjeni ywakwe.” <verse eid="2SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Daudi eze eve ulosi uwo niyo emukwa ni maya vitendese mwa uyo mntu umgoli. Amgamba muoni Nasani, “Nelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta ujima kugamba mntu uyo adamanye ivyo ongigwa akomwe! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Vyaungwa amlihe yudya mchiwa ingoto yakwe, naho nkanana nne, kwaviya kadamanya mbuli ihise naho hana mbazi.” <verse eid="2SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Nasani niyo amgamba Daudi, “Mntu uyo ni weye! Haluse Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, agamba vino, ‘Miye sikuhaka mavuta utende seuta mwa Izulaeli na kukukombola mwemikono ya Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Nasikwinka inyumba ya sekulu ywako na awavyele wakwe watende wako, naho niyo nakwinka awantu wa Izulaeli na Yuda uwalongoze. Hegu ivyo vyendile vijeche, nasikujenyezeza nkanana mbili kujinka ivyo. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Ni mbwani hutimile amalagizo yangu miye Zumbe Chohile niyo wadamanya yehiye kulongozi kwangu? Kumkoma Uliya, Mhiti, kwenkondo, niyo wamguha mkaziwe kumtenda mkaziwo. Kujeseza Waamoni kumkoma Uliya kwe nkondo! <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Haluse kwaviya kunibela, niyo wamguha mkaza Uliya mntu ywe idikabila dya Wahiti kumtenda mkaziwo, elo welekwa wasiku mwe ikaya yako nawakomwe kwa mabamba.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Tegeleza, Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, ‘Kaula, nanihose file mwa awantu wa ikaya yako mwenye. Wavyele wako naniwaguhe ukasinya kwa meso yako nakumwinka mntu ehajihi na weye, uyo nagone nawo molumpe. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Weye kudamanya imbuli iyo chinyele, mna miye naniidamanye molumpe kulongozi kwa Waizulaeli wose.’” <verse eid="2SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo amgamba Nasani, “Sikola masa kwa Zumbe Chohile.” Nasani amgamba, “Zumbe Chohile kakulekeila amasa yako, weye hobanike. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Mna, kwembuli ino utendile kumbelesa Zumbe Chohile, mwanawo nabanike.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Nasani niyo auya kwekaya yakwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 12:15">Mwanawe dya Daudi abanika</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Zumbe Chohile kamtenda umwana ywa Daudi elekwe ni Batisheba mkaza Uliya ywe idikabila dya Wahiti alumwe. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Daudi kafunga na kumlombeza Zumbe Chohile chani umwana apate luhulwilla. Kaita kwechumba chakwe, chilo chose kagona hasi. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Wadalahala wendile walangilizi mwe idizumba idyo niyo wambasa wamweila enuke, mna kalemela, naho hadile nkande yoyose hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Mazuwa mfungate yeze yomboke, yudya mwana niyo abanika. Wandima wa Daudi niyo wogoha kumgambila kugamba umwana kabanika, kwaviya nawafanyanya, “Umo umwana akalumwa chimgambila, mna hachetegeleze. Haluse, nachimgeze kugamba mwanawe kabanika? Adaha kwelumiza.” <verse eid="2SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Daudi eze awawone wandima wakwe watakalisana, niyo abunkula kugamba mwanakwe kabanika. Ivyo, awauza, “Togolani, umwana kabanika?” Nawo niyo wamhitula, “Heye kabanika.” <verse eid="2SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Daudi niyo enuka hadya hasi, ahaka mazi na kwekuluguta mavuta avala suche ntuhu. Akaheza aita mwenyumba ya Chohile avika. Ukaheza auya kaya agamba enkigwe nkande, niyo enkigwa adya. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Wandima wakwe niyo wamuza, “Wausa chisimo chani chino? Umo mwanawo akalumwa kufunga na kumwilia. Mna eze abanike, kwinuka na kudya nkande!” <verse eid="2SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Daudi niyo awahitula, “Chindedi umo umwana endile ni mjima, nasifunga na kwila. Sidamanya ivyo kwaviya nahafanyanya kugamba, ‘Ni yuhi amanyize mafani Zumbe Chohile adaha aniwone mbazi chani mwanangu asigaile mjima.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Mna haluse kabanika nafungila mbwani? Togola! Nadaha kumvuza mweisi? Zuwa dimwenga miye nanite uko etile, mna uyo hakudaha kuya kwangu.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni elekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Vikaheza, Daudi niyo amhongeza mkaziwe Batisheba, niyo agona naye, Batisheba niyo atenda msoka na kwefungula mwana chilume. Daudi niyo amwitanga Solomoni. Zumbe Chohile niyo amunga umwana uyo. <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />Chohile kamlagiza muoni Nasani kwa Daudi kugamba amwitange umwana uyo Yedidia, kugamba akugwa ni Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi ataha umzi wa Laba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1Mihilimo 20:1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Chipindi icho, Yoabu kawebunga umzi wa Laba wa Waamoni, niyo autaha umzi uwo we chiseuta. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yoabu niyo asigila walosi kwa Daudi, kugamba, “Siwebunga umzi wa Laba, miye sidiguha idibwawa dyawo dya amazi. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Haluse wachisanye awagomba nkondo wasigale, wike lago kuuzunguluka na kuutaha. Hegu sivyo, ninautaha wantu nawanitogole miye.” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo awachisanya awagomba nkondo wose aita Laba, kawebunga na kuutaha. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Vikaheza niyo aguha ichilemba cha seuta kulawa momtwi wa mlungu moleki. Uzani wakwe wendaga chilo milongo mitatu na shano za zahabu, mndani mwakwe mwendaga na yuwe dya yombe kulu. Daudi kadiguha na kudijela mwe ichilemba chakwe mwenye. Iviya momzi uwo kataha vintu vilozese. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Vikaheza niyo awaguha awantu wo umzi uwo awaika wadamanye ndima wakajeseza misimeno na sululu za chuma na hoya za chuma na kuwajeseza kudamanya matofali, nivyo adamanye imizi yose ya Waamoni. Daudi niyo auya na awagomba nkondo wose Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Amnoni na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Abusalomu endaga na lumbudye mtana akwitangwa Tamali, Amoni mwana mtuhu ywa Daudi, niyo amungisa Tamali. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amnoni kasulumila vitendese kwa kumunga lumbudye Tamali, kwaviya Tamali nendile henati kujenda na mgosi, naho iwoneka kugamba ni mbuli heikudahika kwa Amnoni kudamanya mbuli yoyose. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Mna Amnoni endaga na mbuyakwe akwitangwa Yonadabu, mwana ywa Shama, mlukolo ywa Daudi, uyo Yonadamu endaga mntu mmanyi vitendese. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Yonadabu niyo amuza Amnoni, “Weye wi mwana ywa seuta, ni mbwani wanyala naho chila zuwa wawoneka kuholola? Kwambwani hukunga kunigambila.?” Amnoni niyo amhitula, “Namunga Tamali, lumbudye dya mlukolo ywangu, Abusalomu.” <verse eid="2SA 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yonadabu niyo amgamba, “Gona mo lusazi kwetende walumwa. Umo iso akeza kukaula, umweile kugamba, ‘Mleke lumbu dyangu Tamali, eze anigaile mkate chani nidye, naho anambikile nkande kulongozi kwangu niiwone, vikaheza anankize mwenye.’” <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Ivyo Amnoni niyo aita akugona kolusazi etenda alumwa. Seuta eze aite kumkaula, Amnoni niyo amgamba, “Nakweila, Tamali eze hano anidamanyize mikate mijeche kuno hamsinya. Vikaheza uyo mwenye anankize.” <verse eid="2SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Ivyo Daudi niyo asigila ulosi kwa Tamali kugamba, aite kwa mkuluwe Amnoni ukamwambikile nkande. <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Tamali niyo aita uko, ambwila Amnoni kagona. Niyo aguha unga aukanda adamanya migate kulongozi kwa Amnoni. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Migate iyo ize yajike, Tamali kaihula kulawa mwe nyungu. Niyo amwigaila Amnoni, mna Amnoni kalemela kuidya, agamba, “Chila mntu afose kuse.” Wose niyo wafose. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Vikaheza, Amnoni niyo amgamba Tamali, “Haluse nigaila imigate iyo kwe chumba changu, ukaheza unankize.” Tamali niyo aiguha imikate amalanye aigala kwechumba cha mkuluwe Amnoni. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Umo akamwinka imikate iyo, Amnoni niyo amgwila amgamba, “Soo chigonanye.” <verse eid="2SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Tamali niyo amgamba, “Mkulu bule usekunikakalisa. Mbuli saino haikutendwa mweisi ya Izulaeli. Usekunidamanya mbuli ya wavu. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Miye sikudaha kujijimiza soni saino. Iviya weye notende yumwenga ywa wahezi wa Izulaeli. Ivyo, nakweila longa na seuta kwaviya hakulemeile unisole.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Mna Amnoni haungile kumwetegeleza naho kwaviya kamhuma nguvu Tamali, kamkakalisa agona naye. <verse eid="2SA 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Vikaheza, Amnoni niyo amwihiwa Tamali vitendese. Kamwihiwa Tamali kujinka viya nakamunga nkongo. Niyo amgamba Tamali, “Sunguza halawe hano!” <verse eid="2SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tamali amhitula, “Mkulu bule, wihi uno wo kunibalaza ni mkulu kujinka udya unitendile.” Mna Amnoni haungile kumwetegeleza. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Niyo amwitanga mndima ywakwe akumsankanila, amgamba, “Mlavye kuse yuno mvyele, ukaheza ulwivi lujele mhindo.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Yudya mndima niyo amlavya kuse avugala ulwivi na mhindo. Tamali nendile kavala nkazu ntali ina mikono mitali, kwaviya suche izo nizo nawakavala wachiche wa seuta hewenati kujenda na mgosi mwe chikale icho. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Elo, Tamali niyo ehaka maivu mo mtwi wakwe, inkazu yakwe ntali availe kaitatula, etwika imikono ko mtwi, akaheza ahalawa kuno aila kwa izwi kulu. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Mkuluwe Abusalomu eze amuwone niyo amuza, “Togola, kugona na mkuluwo Amnoni? Lumbu dyangu tongomala. Uyo ni mkuluwo. Mbuli iyo usekuika mo moyo.” Ivyo Tamali niyo ekala ichedu kuno kasusuhala mwenyumba ya mkuluwe Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Seuta Daudi eze eve imbuli iyo niyo ehiwa vitendese. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Abusalomu niyo amwihiwa vitendese Amnoni vyaleka halongile naye, kwaviya nakamgwila chinguvu lumbudye Tamali niyo agona naye.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abusolomu amkoma Amnoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Mihilimo midi ize ijinke, Abusalomu endaga na awandima wakwe wakukanta mazoya izingoto zakwe uko komzi wa Baali Hasoli hajihi no mzi wa Efulaimu. Niyo awagoneka awana wose we chilume wa seuta kwengasu iyo. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Abusalomu kaita kwa seuta Daudi, amgamba, “Kaula, miye mndima ywako nakanta izingoto zangu amazoya. Nakweila weye seuta hamwenga na awandima wako mwite hamwenga na miye mndima ywako.”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Seuta niyo amhitula Abusalomu, “Mwanangu bule, chisekwita chose, chinase kukwegamila.” Hata hegu Abusalomu kahikiliza kumweila ise vitendese chani aite, mna seuta kalemela, icho atendile ni kumjimbika du. <verse eid="2SA 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Vikaheza, Abusalomu niyo amgamba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">“Hegu hukwita, mleke mlukolo ywangu Amnoni chitanye.” Seuta amuza, “Kwambwani wite naye?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Mna Abusalomu kahikiliza kumweila, uhelo seuta niyo amleka Amnoni na wanawe awatuhu wose waite kwengasu iyo. <verse eid="2SA 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Abusalomu niyo awagamba awandima wakwe, “Msinyiseni Amnoni umo ananywelesa idivai. Aho naniwagambe, ‘Mkomeni Amnoni.’ Idyo nilagizo dyangu kwenyu msekogoha. Mtoge naho mtende wakankalu.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Ivyo awandima wa Abusalomu niyo wamdamanyiza Amnoni saviya walagizwe ni Abusalomu. Vikaheza wana awatuhu wose we chilume wa seuta chila yumwenga kakwela impundafalasi yakwe asumka. <verse eid="2SA 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Umo wechei mwesila, Daudi niyo eva ulosi kugamba wanawe wose wakomwa ni Abusalomu hahana hata yumwenga asigale. <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Seuta Daudi niyo enuka, atatula izisuche zakwe kwa chinyulu niyo agona hasi. Iviya awandima wakwe wose wendile wachimala hajihi naye niyo watatula izisuche zawo. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Mna Yonadamu, mwana ywa Shimeya, mlukolo ywa Daudi niyo amgamba, “Sekulu ywangu, usekufanyanya kugamba wanawo wose wakomwa. Akomigwe ni Amnoni uyodu. Abusalomu ekambaga kudamanya imbuli iyo kukongela hadya Amnoni amgwilaga chinguvu lumbudye Tamali na kugona naye. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Ivyo, sekulu ywangu usekufanyanya mo moyo kugamba wanawo wose wakomwa. Amnoni nuyodu akomigwe.” <verse eid="2SA 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Mna Abusalomu nendile kasumka kale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Ahadya, mbwanga akwamila niyo awona bunga kulu dya wantu wakwiza kulawa kolugulu mwesila ikulawa ntendele ya Holonaimu. Niyo aita akumgambila seuta ivyo awone. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yonadabu niyo amgamba seuta Daudi, “Kaula seuta, wanawo weza, saviya miye mndima ywako hugambile.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Ahadya yudya mndima eze abinde ukulonga, wana we chilume wa seuta niyo wengila, wakonga kuguta waila. Seuta na awandima wakwe wose niyo waila kwa chinyulu. <verse eid="2SA 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Mna Abusalomu kasumkila kwa seuta ywa Geshuli akwitangwa Talimai, mwana ywa Amihudi. Seuta Daudi kamlombolezeza mwanawe Amnoni kwa mazuwa yalozize. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Abusalomu kasumkila komzi wa Geshuli, kekala uko kwa mihilimo mitatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Seuta Daudi eze atondowale file ya Amnoni ize iheze, niyo atenda na nkwina ya kumwona mwanawe Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Abusalomu auya komzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yoabu mwana ywa Seluya, niyo abunkula kugamba seuta Daudi abesa vitendese amuwone mwanawe Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Yoabu niyo asigila wantu waite Tekowa chani wamlondele, mvyele mta ubala kulawa uko. Weze wamwigale, niyo amgamba, “Kwezige saviya wagona matanga. Vala suche za kulomboleza, naho usekwekuluguta mavuta, mna wetende saviya mvyele akulomboleza kwa mazuwa yalozize kwachausa cha wantu wabanike. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Ukaheza, hita kwa seuta ukamgambile ulosi hukusigila.” Yoabu kamgambila imilosi yo kumgambila seuta. <verse eid="2SA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Mvyele uyo kulawa Tekoa niyo aita kwa seuta, enamiza umtwi kulongozi kwa seuta kwa kumtunya, amgamba, “Weye seuta nambiza!” <verse eid="2SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Seuta amuza, “Hwambize mbwani?” Yudya mvyele niyo amhitula, “Nnachinyulu, miye ni mwasigwa mgosi wangu kabanika. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Miye mndima ywako nendaga na wana waidi wa chilume. Zuwa dimwenga, umo wendile kumbago, niyo wakonga kusopana. Kwaviya hakwendaga na mntu yoyose ywa kuwalamuila, yumwenga niyo amtowa na kumkoma mnyawe. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Haluse walukolo wangu wanihituka miye mndima ywako, waunga nimlavye yudya amkomile mnyawe chani wamkome kwaviya kamkoma mlukolo ywakwe. Ivyo nawamkome yudya akunga alisi isanga. Wanatenda ivyo nawause umsuhi wangu usigale, mgosi wangu hasizwe zina hegu mwelekwa mweisi.” <verse eid="2SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Seuta amgamba yudya mvyele, “Uya kaya nanilagize imbuli yako ilahwe.” <verse eid="2SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Yudya mvyele alaile Tekoa niyo amgamba seuta, “Sekulu ywangu seuta, uneva kuna laila nkunto zozose mo ulamuzi uwo zinigwele miye na awantu we ikaya ya tate. Weye no useuta wako msekutenda na mlema.” <verse eid="2SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Seuta amgamba, “Mntu yoyose anakutisa nigaila miye, heze akukufye vituhu.” <verse eid="2SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Yudya mvyele amgamba seuta, “Hampu seuta nilombezeza kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, chani yudya mlukolo ywangu akunga alihize chikoda cha kumkoma mwanangu asekutenda ubanasi mtuhu ikulise ya kumkoma mwanangu umtuhu.” Seuta Daudi amgamba, “Saviya Zumbe akwikala, hahana mbuli yoyose ihiye naimgwele mwanawo.” <verse eid="2SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Yudya mvyele niyo amgamba, “Miye mndima ywako nakulombeza, nileka nilonge mbuli imwenga du mwako weye seuta.” Seuta amgamba, “Longa.” <verse eid="2SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Yudya mvyele amgamba, “Elo ni mbwani, kwekamba utende wihi uno mwa awantu wa Chohile? Kuligana na viya ulamule imbuli ino weye mwenye kwekantila kutenda na mlema kwaviya humlekele mwanawo auye kaya kulawa kudya asumkile. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Suwe chose nachibanike suwe chose nisaviya mazi yetike hayakukubika. Mna Zumbe Chohile hakuvuza mntu abanike atende mjima vituhu, mna seuta adaha kumvuza mntu kulawa koujeni kudya asumkile. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Miye siza kulonga na weye, sekulu ywangu seuta, kwaviya wanitisa. Ivyo, miye mndima ywako, sifanyanya kugamba, ‘Hampu halonge na seuta, vyadahika nachintize viya hunga miye mndima ywakwe. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Kwaviya seuta nanetegeleze na kunikombola mwe mikono yo mntu akunga anikome miye hamwenga na mwanangu kulawa mo ulisi wa Chohile achinkile.’ <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Miye mndima ywako nasifanyanya kugamba, ‘Ulosi wa seuta ywangu nauninke utondowazi mo moyo, kwaviya weye seuta ywangu ni saviya mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile mwe kubunkula yedi na yehiye.’ Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, atende hamwenga na weye.” <verse eid="2SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Aho seuta amgamba yudya mvyele, “Usekunifisa mbuli yoyose hunga huze.” Yudya mvyele niyo agamba, “Longa sekulu ywangu seuta.” <verse eid="2SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Seuta niyo amuza, “Togola! Suyo Yoabu akugambile imbuli ino?” Mvyele yudya niyo ahitula, agamba, “Saviya ukujendeleza noujima, sekulu ywangu seuta mntu hakudaha kwenega kulume hegu kumoso, mwe imbuli ulongile sekulu ywangu seuta, kwaviya Yoabu yudya umndima ywako nuyo anisigile. Uyo nuyo anigambile izimbuli zose zino hugambile miye mndima ywako. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Yoabu kadamanya ivyo chani izimbuli zino zikale vyedi. Mna, weye sekulu ywangu, una umanyi saviya mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile, wadaha kumanya mbuli zose zimweisi.” <verse eid="2SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Vikaheza, seuta niyo amgamba Yoabu, “Haluse tegeleza, nanidamanye imbuli ino chani umvuze kaya yudya mbwanga Abusalomu.” <verse eid="2SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yoabu kenamiza hasi amtunya seuta, amvikila na kumungila seuta ujimbiko, akagamba, “Dyelo miye mndima ywako, sekulu ywangu seuta, simanya kugamba kunizumila kulongozi kwako, kwa kudizumila idilombezo dyangu.” <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Ivyo Yoabu niyo ahalawa aita Geshuli, akumvuza Abusalomu komzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Mna seuta niyo agamba, “Abusalomu ekale hale na miye, ekale kwenyumbakwe. Asekwiza hano kunikaula.” Ivyo Abusalomu niyo atenda ekala hale kwekaya yakwe naho hamuwone seuta Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abusalomu na seuta Daudi wevana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Mweisi yose ya Izulaeli, hahana atogolwe kwa utana saviya Abusalomu. Kukongela kolwayo kubula kwedifofo, Abusalomu hendaga na lema dyodyose. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Chila akawegula izifili zakwe, chila uhelo wa mhilimo nakawegula izifili zakwe kwaviya nazimzamila, eze azihime uzami wakwe wendaga chilo mbili kuligana nevihimo vye chiseuta. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abusalomu elekaga wana watatu wa chilume hamwenga na mchiche yumwenga zina dyakwe etangagwa Tamali. Tamali endaga mndele mtana vitendese. <verse eid="2SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Abusalomu kekala komzi wa Yelusalemu mihilimo midi mijima hemuwone seuta Daudi uso wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Vikaheza, Abusalomu niyo amwigaila ulosi Yoabu, chani amsigile egale ulosi kwa seuta, mna Yoabu niyo alemela. Abusalomu kamwitanga nkanana ya kaidi mna Yoabu kalemela. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Ivyo, Abusalomu niyo awagamba awandima wakwe, “Kaulani Yoabu ana nkonde ya shayili ihajihi ne iyangu. Hitani mkaichulike moto inkonde iyo.” Ivyo awandima wa Abusalomu niyo waichulika moto inkonde ya Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Yoabu, niyo aita kukaya kwa Abusalomu amuza, “Ni mbwani awandima wako weza kuchulika moto inkonde yangu?” <verse eid="2SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abusalomu niyo amhitula Yoabu, “Kaula, sikwigaila ulosi, wize kuno chani husigile kwa seuta ukanuzize, ‘Ni mbwani siza kulawa Geshuli? Vyendaga vyedi kwangu hegu nasigale uko.’ Haluse nambiza chani nimwone seuta. Hegu nina mlema anikome.” <verse eid="2SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Ivyo, Yoabu niyo ambasa na kumgambila seuta izimbuli izo zose. Seuta niyo amwitanga Abusalomu, niyo engila kwa seuta, enama kubula hasi kulongozi kwa seuta. Seuta niyo amkubatila Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Abusalomu amhituka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Mbuli izo zize ziheze, Abusalomu niyo emalanyiza malingisha ya nkondo ya kubuluzwa ni falasi na falasi hamwenga na wantu milongo mishano wakumlongoila. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Abusalomu azwelaga kwinuka mtondo chilochilo, na kuchimala hankanda hesila ikuhinga kwenchili yo umzi. Mntu yoyose endile na milosi akunga amwigaile seuta chani alahilwe, Abusalomu nendile akamwitangila hankanda uyo mntu amuza, “Weye walawa komzi uhi?” Uneva uyo mntu anagamba alawa kwemzi msiku wa kabila dya izulaeli, <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Abusalomu nendile akamgamba, “Ulahi wako wawagilisa. Mna hahana mntu asagulwe ni seuta akwetegeleze.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Naho Abusalomu agamba, “Hegu miye nekigwe kutenda mlamuzi mwe isi ino ya Izulaeli! Chila mntu mta ulahi hegu milosi ezile kwangu, miye nasimwinka vikuwagila!” <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Kujinka ayo, Abusalomu kachulusa umkono wakwe niyo amkumbatila na kumbusu mntu yoyose ezile kumfunamila na kumfila madi. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Ivyo niyo Abusalomu awadamanyize Waizulaeli wose, wezile kunga ulamuzi kwa seuta. Kwa kudamanya ivyo Abusalomu kawaluvya Waizulaeli wamtimile. <verse eid="2SA 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Mihilimo mine ize ijinke, Abusalomu niyo amgamba seuta “Hampu unileke nite uko Hebuloni chani hachintize nazili yangu iyo nimwikiye Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Kwaviya miye mndima ywako, umo hekala Geshuli mweisi ya Alamu, nasimwikia nazili Zumbe Chohile hagamba, uneva Zumbe Chohile ananivuza komzi wa Yelusalemu, nanimvikile komzi wa Hebuloni.” <verse eid="2SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Seuta niyo amgamba, “Weye hita kwa utondowazi.” Abusalomu niyo ahalawa aita Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Mna Abusalomu kasigila walosi chinyele mwa awantu wa amakabila yose ya Izulaeli wagambe, “Aho namwivile izwi dya gunda, gambani, ‘Abusalomu ni seuta uko Hebuloni.’” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Umo Abusalomu akaita Hebuloni, kaita na wantu magana maidi agoneke kulawa Yelusalemu, awo waita kwa vyedi, hawamanyize mbuli yoyose yo mwalo uwo wa Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Umo Abusalomu akalavya ntambiko, kasigila ulosi komzi wa Gilo kumwitanga Ahitofeli, uyo endaga mlangilizi ywa seuta Daudi. Ukuhituka kwa Abusalomu kutenda na nguvu, wantu ajesanye nawo niyo wajenyela.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Daudi asumka komzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Mlosi ambasaga Daudi na kumgamba, “Wantu wa Izulaeli welunga na Abusalomu!” <verse eid="2SA 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo awagamba awandima wakwe wendile hamwenga naye komzi wa Yelusalemu, “Chimalani chiguluke, hegu sivyo, hachidahe kumwenega Abusalomu. Chisunguze kuhalawa anasekuchigaila file na kuubalanga umzi.” <verse eid="2SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Mna awandima wakwe niyo wamgamba, “Suwe wandima wako, sekulu ywetu seuta, chetumba kudamanya dyodyose nolagize.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Ivyo, seuta niyo ahalawa hamwenga na awantu we ikaya yakwe, mna kasa vilaga vyakwe mlongo wadamanye ndima za mnyumba. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Seuta niyo ahalawa hamwenga na awantu wakwe wose. Mna weze wabule nyumba ikohelo wo umzi niyo waika ntulwe hadodo. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Awandima wose wa seuta na Wakeleti wose na Wapeleti wose, hamwenga na Wagiti, magana mtandatu wamtimile seuta Daudi walaile komzi wa Gati, wahalawa hamwenga naye wakamlongoila. <verse eid="2SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Seuta Daudi niyo amgamba Itai, Mgiti, “Ni mbwani hata weye kuhalawa hamwenga na suwe? Uya ukekale na Abusalomu seuta mhya. Kwaviya weye kuno wimjeni, naho wi mnyika kulawa kukaya kwenyu. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Weye kwiza kuno ivino mazuzi du. Togola, hutende mntu ywa kuchonga hamwenga na suwe, wamanyize kugamba miye simanyize uko hwita, Uya kaya hamwenga na walukolo wako. Chohile nakulagise wedi na ukanuni wakwe” <verse eid="2SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Itai niyo amhitula seuta, “Chindedi saviya Chohile akwikala na weye sekulu ywangu seuta ukujendeleza kutenda mjima, hohose notende, uneva ni kwa file hegu ni kwikala, miye mndima ywako nanitende aho.” <verse eid="2SA 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Daudi niyo amgamba Itai, “Nivyedi, longola jendeleza kulongozi.” Ivyo, Itai, Mgiti, niyo ajinka yeye mwenye hamwenga na awantu we ikaya yakwe. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Daudi eze atende ajinka hamwenga na awantu wakwe, wantu wose mweisi watula ndilo waila kwa izwi. Seuta Daudi kadeluka kamto ka Kiduloni hamwenga na awantu wose, wajinka wahinga kwedijangwa. <verse eid="2SA 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Mlavyantambiko Abiatali kafosa, iviya mlavyantambiko Sadoki kafosa hamwenga na Walawi wose kuno wadinula idishanduku dye dilagano dya Chohile. Idishanduku dya Chohile wadika hasi Abiatali kalavya ntambiko kubula awantu wose weze wajinke kulawa komzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Vikaheza, seuta niyo amgamba Sadoki, “Divuze komzi wa Yelusalemu idishanduku dye idilagano dya Zumbe Chohile. Hegu nazumilika kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, vyadahika nanivuze na kunidahiza nidiwone vituhu idisanduku dyakwe na kuwona ahantu hakwe dikwikala. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Mna hegu sikuzumilika kwa Zumbe Chohile, miye semalanya kale anitendele chochose chiya akunga.” <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Seuta Daudi niyo amgamba vituhu mlavyantambiko Sadoki, “Mguhe mwanawo Ahimaasi na Yonasani mwana ywa Abiatali muye kaya kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Mna miye nanigoje kwedilomo dikwenyika, kubula nive ulosi kulawa kwako.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Ivyo Sadoki na Abiatali wadivuza idishanduku dye idilagano dya Zumbe Chohile komzi wa Yelusalemu, wowo niyo wekala uko. <verse eid="2SA 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Mna Daudi kajendeleza, kukwela ulugulu lwe mizaituni kuno akaila, havaile vilatu, umtwi wakwe ugubikwa. Iviya wantu endile hamwenga nawo wose wagubika imitwi yawo wakwela ulugulu kuno waila. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Daudi niyo agambilwa kugamba, Ahitofeli naye endaga yumwenga ywa wadya wamhituke welungile na Abusalomu, Daudi amlombeza Zumbe Chohile agamba, “Weye Zumbe Chohile, nakweila, mwalo wa Ahitofeli usekuchumilwa.” <verse eid="2SA 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Daudi eze abule kolunenengwe lo lugulu, hantu ha kumvikila Chohile, mntu yumwenga akwitangwa Hushai kulawa Aliki keza chani amhokele, suche zakwe zikatenda zitatuka, na lumbi komtwi wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Daudi niyo amgamba, “Unaita hamwenga na miye, honambize chochose. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Mna unauya komzi wa Yelusalemu na kumgambila Abusalomu, ‘Weye seuta nanitende mndima ywako, saviya nendaga mndima ywa tati yako kukongela aho nkongo.’ Aho, mwalo wa Ahitofeli mwangu hauchumilwe. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Walavyantambiko Sadoki na Abiatali nawatende hamwenga na weye uko komzi! Ivyo chochose ukunga wive kulawa mwe nyumba ya seuta, wagambile walavyantambiko Sadoki na Abiatali. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Wana wawo waidi wa chilume, Ahimaasi mwana ywa Sadoki na Yonasani mwana ywa Abiatali awo nawo wehamwenga na walavya ntambiko. Chochose mkunga mwive wagambileni awo nawanigambile miye.” <verse eid="2SA 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Ivyo Hushai, mbuyaye dya Daudi niyo auya komzi mwe ichipindi icho umo Abusalomu akengila momzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Seuta Daudi na Siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Daudi eze omboke hadodo kulanga ko lunenengwa ko lugulu, Siba mndima ywa Mefibosheti niyo amhokela Daudi akatenda na mpunda mbili kuno wenula mikate magana maidi, vikocha gana vya zabibu ziiviye na nyiko za ntunda gana na kabuyu ka divai. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Seuta niyo amuza Siba, “Ni mbwani kwigala vino ivintu?” Siba amhitula, “Mpunda ni kwachausa cha kukwela awantu we ikaya yako, mikate na izitunda ni kwachausa cha awambwanga wose, idivai ni kwachausa cha wadya nawasokele kwe dijangwa.” <verse eid="2SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Seuta niyo amuza, “Mefibosheti mwana ywa sekulu ywako ekuhi?” Siba niyo amhitula seuta, “Uyo kasigala komzi wa Yelusalemu, kwaviya kafanyanya kugamba awantu wa Izulaeli nawamvuzize useuta wa babakwe Sauli.” <verse eid="2SA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Seuta niyo amgamba Siba, “Chila chintu naanacho Mefibosheti haluse ni vyako.” Siba niyo amgamba, “Sekulu ywangu seuta nakweila, miye nalombeza ninkigwe wedi kulongozi kwako mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimei amligita Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Umo, Daudi eze abule kudya Bahulimu, Kalaila mntu yumwenga ywa ulukolo lwa Sauli, zina dyakwe etangwa Shimei mwana ywa Gela, niyo akonga kumligita Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Niyo atenda amduila mayuwe seuta Daudi hamwenga na awandima wakwe. Wantu watuhu wose na wagomba nkondo wose niyo watenda wamzunguluka Daudi ntendele ya kulume na kumoso. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimei kamligita Daudi akagamba, “Halawe hano, halawe hano, weye mntu mkomi, mntu hwine dyodyose! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Zumbe Chohile kakuliha chikoda kwaviya kwitila isakame yose yo lukolo lwa Sauli, haluse kuguha useuta hantu hakwe. Haluse, Chohile kamwinka useuta Abusalomu mwanawo. Kaula, haluse ubanasi ukugwela kwaviya weye wimkomi!” <verse eid="2SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Niyo Abishai mwana ywa Seluya, amgamba seuta, “Ni mbwani dino idikuli difile dikuligite weye sekulu ywangu seuta? Nileka nimbase, miye nanimsenge utwi wakwe.” <verse eid="2SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Mna seuta niyo amgamba, “Togola, kuna mbwani mgati mwangu na nyuwe wana wa Seluya? Uneva Chohile kamgamba, ‘Mligite Daudi’, ni yuhi akudaha kuza, ‘Ni mbwani kudamanya ivyo?’” <verse eid="2SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Naho seuta Daudi niyo amgamba Abishai na awandima wakwe wose, “Uneva mwanangu mwenye aunga anikome, togola siyo kujinka mntu ywa kabila dya Benjamini? Nyuwe mlekeni aniligite kwaviya Chohile kamlagiza aniligite. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Mafani Chohile nakaule amasulumizo yangu, niyo aniliha wedi kwa dino idiligito hwinkwa dyelo.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Ivyo seuta Daudi na awantu wakwe niyo wajendeleza ne intambo, kuno Shimei amtimila akamdwila mayuwe na kumfilisiza lumbi seuta Daudi. Shimei nendile akajenda mlanga mo lugulu akasinyana na seuta Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Seuta na awantu wakwe wose wendile hamwenga naye wabula komto wa Yolodani wakatenda wasokelesa. Elo niyo watweta.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abusalomu komzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Abusalomu na awantu wose wa Izulaeli, niyo waita komzi wa Yelusalemu, Ahitofeli naye endaga hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Hushai kulawa komzi wa Aliki mbuyaye dya Daudi niyo ambasa Abusalomu, amgamba, “Wikalise seuta! Wikalise seuta!” <verse eid="2SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Abusalomu niyo amuza Hushai, “Togola, uno nuwo ungi wako kwa mbuyayo Daudi? Kwambwani hwitile hamwenga na mbuyayo?” <verse eid="2SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushai niyo amhitula Abusalomu, “Bule sivyo ivyo, yudya asagulwe ni Zumbe na awantu wano, na awantu wose wa Izulaeli, uyo nuyo miye nanitende ywakwe, naho nanikale hamwenga naye. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Kujinka ayo, togola nimsankanile yuhi? Togola, suyo mwana ywa mbuyangu? Ivyo, saviya nimsankanile tati yako nivyo hunga husankanile weye.” <verse eid="2SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Abusalomu niyo amgamba Ahitofeli, “Nigambila chitende zeze?” <verse eid="2SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahitofeli amgamba Abusalomu, “Gona ne ivilaga vya tati yako, awo asize chani wasinye inyumbakwe. Nyumani awantu wose wa Izulaeli waneva kugamba kwetenda ihizo kwa tati yako, aho wantu wose wehamwenga na weye nawengile nguvu.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Ivyo, wantu niyo wamhindila hema Abusalomu mlanga mwe idihala dye inyumba, Abusalomu niyo agona ne ivilaga vya tati yakwe Waizulaeli wose wakasinya. <verse eid="2SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Mazuwa ayo, ulangilizi wowose alavize Ahitofeli wendaga saviya ulavigwa ni Chohile. Naho ulangilizi uwo Daudi na Abusalomu wautimila.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Hushai amwazaganya Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Kujinka ayo, Ahitofeli amgambaga Abusalomu, “Nileka nisagule wantu elufu mlongo na milongo midi, dyelo nechilo nihalawe nimtimile Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Nanimwebunge akatenda kasokela na kufa chevu, miye nanimjele luchenyenta. Awantu wose wehamwenga naye nawasumke. Nanimkome seuta uyodu, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />naniwavuze awantu awatuhu wose kwawo. File ya mntu yumwenga naihose wantu wose watende na utondowazi.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Ulosi uwo wa Ahitofeli umuwagila Abusalomu na awadalahala wose wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Abusalomu niyo agamba, “Iviya, mwitangeni Hushai mntu ywa Aliki, chive idyo akunga alonge.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Hushai eze abule kwa Abusalomu, Abusalomu niyo amuza, “Ivyo nivyo alongile Ahitofeli. Togola, chidamanye seivyo achilangilize? Hegu sivyo ivyo, hake chigambile dyokudamanya.” <verse eid="2SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Hushai niyo amgamba Abusalomu, “Ulangilizi alavize Ahitofeli ichipindi chino suwo wedi.” <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Kujinka ayo, Hushai niyo amgamba, “Weye kumanya kugamba tati yako na awantu wakwe ni wakankalu na kugamba wehiwa saviya kala vyele dihokigwe awana kumbago. Ukaleka ayo, kumanya kugamba tati yako ni mkankalu ywa nkondo. Uyo hekale hamwenga na awantu wakwe chilo chose. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Hata vino haluse kefisa kale mwe mpanga siku mgati mwe izimpanga ziyuko hegu hantu hatuhu. Umo Daudi anakonga kuwebunga awantu wako, yoyose akunga eve ivyo nagambe awantu wa Abusalomu wahudwa. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Ivyo wadya awagomba nkondo wako awakankalu wata moyo saviya wa kala, nawengile chevu vitendese kwa nkama. Kwaviya Waizulaeli wose wamanya kugamba tati yako ni mkankalu, na wantu wehamwenga naye ni wakankalu. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Fanyanyi zangu nikugamba, wachisanye awantu wose wa Izulaeli kukongela Dani ntendele ya chenya kubula Beeli Sheba ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi, watende walozesa saviya msanga wa mpwani, na weye mwenye wite kwe nkondo. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Suwe nachimlonde Daudi hantu hohose akudaha kuwoneka nachimwebunge saviya mnyuzu ukugubika isanga. Ivyo, hahana akunga asigale hata hegu nuyo mwenye hegu awantu wakwe we hamwenga naye. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Uneva kasumkila mwemzi msiku, ivyo awagomba nkondo wose wa Izulaeli nawegale sigi na kuukwekwesa umzi uwo kubula kwedikolongo, kusekusigala hata yumwe komzi uwo.” <verse eid="2SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Abusalomu na awantu wose wa Izulaeli niyo wagamba, “Fanyanyi za Hushai ni zedi kujinka fanyanyi za Ahitofeli.” Niyo walemela fanyanyi zedi za Ahitofeli kwaviya Zumbe Chohile endaga kekamba kubalanga izifanyanyi zedi za Ahitofeli, chani amwigaile file Abusalomu.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi agambigwa na kusumka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Vikaheza, Hushai niyo awagamba walavyantambiko, Sadoki na Abiatali ivyo Ahithofeli amlangilize Abusalomu na wadalahala wa Izulaeli na miye ivyo niwalangilize watende. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Niyo awagamba wasunguze kumwigaila ulosi Daudi kugamba nechilo asekugona mwe idilomo uko kwenyika, mna kwa sila yoyose idya, adeluke na kuhalawa chani anese kugwilwa na kukomwa, yeye hamwenga na awantu wakwe wose. <verse eid="2SA 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Yonasani na Ahimaasi nendile wakagoja hajihi na Eni logeli, chani wasekuwonwa ni mntu yoyose wekengila komzi. Chila nkanana mndima msiku ywa chiche nendile akamwigaila ulosi, awo nawo nendile wakamwigaila seuta Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Mna chipindi chino wawonwa ni mbwanga yumwenga, niyo akumgambila Abusalomu. Ivyo, Yonasani na Ahimaasi niyo wasunguza kuhalawa, waita Bahulimu, kwekaya ya mntu msiku mta chisima ko uwa wakwe. Niyo wengila mndani mwechisima icho wefisa. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Mvyele mta ikaya iyo niyo aguha ngubiko akugubika ichisima icho, akajika niyo anika ngano mlanga mwe ngubiko. Hahana mntu amanyize izimbuli iyo. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Wagomba nkondo wa Abusalomu weze wabule kwa uyo mvyele, niyo wamuza, “Ahimaasi na Yonasani wekuhi?” Yudya mvyele niyo awahitula, “Wadeluka waita ntendele ya kaidi ya kamto kamazi.” Weze wawalonde na kuwaswesa, niyo wauya komzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Wagomba nkondo wa Abusalomu weze wahalawe, Yonasani na Ahimaasi niyo wafosa mwe chisima, waita wakumgambila seuta Daudi ulosi uwo. Niyo wamgamba, “Halawe wite ntendele ya kaidi yomto, kwaviya Ahitofeli kamlangiliza Abusalomu kukulanga weye.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Ivyo Daudi niyo ahalawa na awantu wose wehamwenga naye, wadeluka umto wa Yolodani. Ize ibule mtondo hahana mntu asigale henati kudeluka umto wa Yolodani. <verse eid="2SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahitofeli eze awone kugamba ulangilizi wakwe hautimilwe, niyo amalanya izimpunda zakwe, aita kukaya kwakwe. Eze abule uko kamalanya izimbuli za mwenyumbakwe, niyo enyulika abanika, niyo ahambwa mwe mbila ya tati yakwe. <verse eid="2SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Daudi niyo aita Mahanaimu. Abusalomu niyo adeluka umto wa Yolodani na awagomba nkondo wose wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Abusalomu nendile kamwika Amasa atende sekulu ywa awagomba nkondo hantu ha Yoabu. Amasa endaga mwana ywa mntu akwitangwa Yitila ywa kabila dya Ishimaeli. Nine dya Amasa nendile aketangwa Abigali, mchiche ywa Nahashi, endaga lumbudye dya Seluya, nine dya Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Abusalomu hamwenga na awagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli niyo waika lago mweisi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="2SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Daudi eze abule Mahanaimu, Shobi, mwana ywa Nahashi ywe idikabila dya Amoni kulawa komzi wa Laba na Makili, mwana ywa Amieli kulawa komzi wa Lo Debali, hamwenga na Balizilai ywe idikabila dya Gileadi kulawa komzi wa Logelimu, <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />wegala micheka na mabakuli na via vya ulongo na ngano na shaili na unga na mabuli na nkunde na dengu, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />uchi, mabongo na ngoto na samli kulawa mo uludimo lwawo wamwigaila Daudi hamwenga na awantu endaga nawo. Kwaviya walonga, “Wantu wano wana sala, wasokela naho wana nchilu kwa chausa che ntambo kwe dijangwa.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Abusalomu ahudwa na kukomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Daudi awawazaga awagomba nkondo wakwe endile hamwenga nawo, niyo awaika mwemabunga ya maelufu wakalongozwa ni masekulu wawo na mabunga ya magana nayo nendile yakalongozwa ni masekulu wawo. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Daudi niyo awegala awagomba nkondo wakwe kwe nkondo, mwe mabunga matatu, bunga dimwenga walongozwa ni Yoabu na bunga dya kaidi walongozwa ni Abishai, mwana wa Seluya mlukolo ywa Yoabu, na bunga dya katatu walongozwa ni Itai ywe idikabila dya Wagiti. Seuta niyo awagamba wantu, “Usani nkama miye mwenye nanite hamwenga na nyuwe.” <verse eid="2SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Mna awagomba nkondo wamgamba, “Weye usekwita, kwaviya chinasumka, hawafanyanye ni suwe wahi. Hegu inusa yetu nawakomwe, iviya hawafanyanye ni suwe wahi. Mna weye yombe dyako ni kulu kujinka wantu elufu mlongo mgati mwetu. Ivyo, navitende vyedi hegu weye nosigale ahano chani unachigaile wambizi ukatenda wihano homzi.” <verse eid="2SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Seuta niyo awagamba, “Dyodyose mkudiwona ni dyedi kwenyu, naniditende.” Ivyo, seuta niyo achimala hankanda henchili kuno awagomba nkondo wakwe wakajinka, magana kwa maelufu. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Seuta niyo awalagiza Yoabu na Abishai na Itai, “Mdamanyizeni yedi yudya mbwanga Abusalomu kwachausa changu.” Wantu wose wamwiva seuta umo akawalagiza amasekulu wa awagomba nkondo wakwe kumlanga Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Ivyo, wagomba nkondo wa Daudi niyo waita kwenyika wakugomba nkondo na Waizulaeli. Nkondo igombelwa mwembago ya Efulaimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Wagomba nkondo wa Daudi niyo wawahuda awagomba nkondo wa Abusalomu. Mwe idizuwa idyo kwendaga na file nkulu kwaviya wagomba nkondo elufu milongo midi wakomagwa. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Nkondo iyo izagala mweisi yose na wantu walozize wafila kumbago kujinka wadya wakomigwe kwa sime kwenkondo. <verse eid="2SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Chipumpa, Abusalomu akatenda kakwela impunda falasi yakwe, niyo adugana na wagomba nkondo wasiku wa Daudi. Impunda falasi iyo umo ikajinka hasi hetambi kulu dya mti wa mwaloni, umtwi wa Abusalomu niyo wafyata momti uwo. Abusalomu niyo asigwa anemanema halanga. Mna impunda falasi yakwe ijendeleza kulongozi. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Mntu msiku awone imbuli iyo ikalaila niyo aita akumgambila Yoabu, “Simwona Abusalomu anemanema mwe mti wa mwaloni.” <verse eid="2SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yoabu niyo amuza uyo mntu, “Mbwani? Kumwona Abusalomu? Elo, ni mbwani ukaleka kumtowa aho agwe hasi? Hegu wamkomile naselelwa kukuliha mayuwe ya chumbu milongo na msipi.” <verse eid="2SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Mna yudya mntu niyo amgamba Yoabu, “Hata hegu nawone uzami wa mayuwe ya chumbu elufu momkono wangu, sachuluse umkono wangu nimkome mwana ywa seuta. Kwaviya, chimwiva seuta umo akawalagizani weye na Abishai na Itai kugamba kwachausa chakwe, mdimeni mbwanga Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Hegu samwivile seuta viya alongile na kumkoma Abusalomu niyo seuta aiva imbuli iyo, kwaviya hahana chikwefisa kwa seuta, weye mwenye nendile kunihituka.” <verse eid="2SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yoabu niyo amgamba, “Chisekudedelesana, weye wanikawiza vya bule”. Yoabu niyo aguha mifulo mitatu kaita na kumtunga Abusalomu mo moyo, umo akatungwa, Abusalomu nendile achei mjima mweditambi dyo mti wo mwaloni. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Vikaheza, wabwanga mlongo wakwinula iviziha vya Yoabu, niyo wamzunguluka Abusalomu wamtowa na kumkoma. <verse eid="2SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Elo, Yoabu niyo atowa gunda vyaleka wagomba nkondo wose waleka kuwatimila wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Waguha ichimba cha Abusalomu wachidula mwe bome kulu kumbago na kumumbikila chisungu chikulu cha mayuwe. Wagomba nkondo wose wasigale wa Izulaeli chila yumwenga kanyilika kaita kukaya kwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Mo ujima wakwe Abusalomu, endaga kechimalisiza nguzo ya lukumbusa kwedikolongo dya seuta, kwaviya nakagamba, “Miye sina mwana ywa chilume ywa kujendeleza idizina dyangu chani nikumbukwe.” Nguzo iyo kainka zina dyakwe, naho yetangwa nguzo ya Abusalomu kubula vino dyelo.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi agambilwa ifile ya Abusalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Vikaheza, Ahimaasi mwana ywa Sadoki, niyo amgamba Yoabu, “Nileka niguluke nimwigaile seuta ulosi uno kugamba Chohile kamkombola mwe nguvu za awankondo wakwe.” <verse eid="2SA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yoabu amgamba, “Dyelo, howigale ulosi uno. Wadaha kwigala ulosi uno zuwa tuhu. Mna dyelo howigale ulosi wowose kwaviya mwana ywa seuta kakomwa.” <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Aho, Yoabu niyo amgamba mntu yumwenga, Mkushi, “Weye, hita kamgambile seuta yadya uwone.” Yudya Mkushi niyo afunama kulongozi kwa Yoabu kwa kumtunya, niyo ahalawa kwa nguluko. <verse eid="2SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ahimaasi mwana ywa Sadoki niyo amgamba vituhu Yoabu, “Havinani leka nami nimgulukile yudya Mkushi!” Yoabu amgamba, “Ni mbwani wonga uguluke mwanagu? Kwaviya weye howinkigwe chochose mwe imbuli ino!” <verse eid="2SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ahimaasi amgamba, “Havinani, naniguluke.” Yoabu niyo amgamba, “Haya guluka.” Elo, Ahimaasi niyo aguluka akahinga ne sila ya kwenyika niyo amhota yudya Mkushi. <verse eid="2SA 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Daudi endaga kekala mgati mwe nchili mbili zo umzi. Mwamizi ywe inchili nakakwela mwechiwambaza eze adule meso yakwe awona mntu akwiza akaguluka. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Uyo mwamizi niyo enula izwi amgambila seuta. Seuta niyo amgamba, “Hegu echedu, vyadahika ana mbuli yedi.” Yudya mntu ahikiliza kusogela. <verse eid="2SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Mwamizi niyo amwona mntu mtuhu akwiza akaguluka, Niyo etanga vituhu ho lwivi akagamba, “Kaula, kuna mntu mtuhu akwiza akaguluka!” Seuta niyo agamba, “Uyo naye achigaila mbuli yedi.” <verse eid="2SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Yudya mwamizi niyo amgamba, “Nawona kugamba yudya amlongoile umnyawe aguluka saviya Ahimaasi mwana ywa Sadoki.” Seuta niyo amgamba, “Uyo ni mntu ywedi, achigaila ulosi wedi.” <verse eid="2SA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Ahimaasi niyo amgamba seuta kwa izwi kulu, “Mbuli zose zichuma.” Niyo afunama chifudifudi kulongozi kwa seuta, akagamba, “Atogolwe Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, akukombole kulawa mwa awantu awo wakuhituke weye sekulu ywangu seuta!” <verse eid="2SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Seuta auza, “Togola! Yudya mbwanga, Abusalomu, ni mjima?” Ahimaasi niyo ahitula, “Yoabu eze anisigile miye mndima ywako, nasiva nguto nkulu, mna luhosa lwakwe silumanyize.” <verse eid="2SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Seuta niyo agamba, “Hituka uchimale aho hankanda.” Ahimaasi niyo ahituka, achimala hankanda. <verse eid="2SA 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Aho yudya Mkushi niyo abula, naye niyo agamba, “Hana ulosi wedi sekulu ywangu seuta! Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile dyelo kakukombola kulawa mwa wadya wose wakuhituke.” <verse eid="2SA 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Seuta niyo amuza, “Togola mbwanga Abusalomu evihi?” Mkushi niyo ahitula, “Wehi wako, sekulu ywangu seuta, hamwenga na wose wakunga watowane na weye wakakungiya yehiye, watende sayadya yambwile uyo mbwanga Abusalomu.” <verse eid="2SA 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Aho seuta niyo engilwa ni chinyulu chikulu, kakwela mwe chumba chendile kulanga he nchili ya kulume. Umo akakwela, nendile akaila kuno agamba, “Hoi mwanangu Abusalomu, mwanangu Abusalomu! Navitenda vyedi nabanike miye ukaleka weye! Hoi, Abusalomu mwanangu! Mwanangu!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu amkwamila seuta Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Yoabu nakagambilwa kugamba seuta endaga akaila na kulomboleza ifile ya Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Kwaivyo, uhuda we idizuwa idyo uhitulwa kutenda malombolezo kwa wantu wose, weze weve kugamba seuta amlombolezeza Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Ivyo, zuwa idyo, wantu wengila ko mzi dwidwidi saviya wantu wakuya komzi wakawona soni kwa kusumka nkondo. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Seuta kagubika uso wakwe na kwila kwa izwi kulu akagamba, “Hoi, mwanangu Abusalomu! Hoi mwanangu! Mwanangu! Mwanangu!” <verse eid="2SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Ivyo Yoabu niyo engila kunyumba kwa seuta, amgamba, “Dyelo kuchijela soni suwe awandima wako wose, awo chikombole ujima wako no ujima wa wanawo no ujima wa wachiche wako, no ujima wa wakazizo no ujima we ivilaga vyako. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Weye wawaunga wadya wehi wako na kuwehiwa wadya wakukunga. Kuchilagisa pwilili dyelo kugamba wakankalu na wagomba nkondo wako chiwabule kulongozi kwako. Nawona dyelo nakwelelwa hegu Abusalomu nendile ni mjima na suwe chose nachikomwa. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Haluse, chimala ukalonge na awagomba nkondo wako mpalahole. Kwaviya nelisa kwa Chohile, saviya nendaga halonga nawo, hahana hata yumwenga akunga asigale hamwenga na weye dyelo nechilo. Ino naitende mbuli ihiye kwako kujinka yehiye yose yakumbwile kukongela umbwanga wako kubula dyelo.” <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Vikaheza, seuta niyo afosa aita ekala ahantu hakwe hechedu hajihi ne inchilli. Wantu wose weze wagambilwe kugamba seuta ekwenchili, wose niyo wambasa kulawa kwezinyumba zawo wamzunguluka.<verse eid="2SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi auya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Wantu wose nendile wakahigana wowo wenye mwa amakabila yose ya Izulaeli, wakagamba, “Seuta Daudi kachikombola mwe mikono ya wehi wetu, kachikombola mwe mikono ya Wafilisiti. Mna haluse kaisumka isi, akamnyilika Abusalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Naho Abusalomu uyo chimhakile mavuta atende seuta ywentu, kakomwa kwe nkondo. Haluse, ni mbwani hachikulonga mwe kumvuza seuta Daudi?” <verse eid="2SA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Seuta Daudi niyo asigila ulosi kwa walavyantambiko Sadoki na Abiatali, “Wagambileni vilongozi wa Yuda, ‘Kwambwani wowo watende nawo wazigile kumvuza seuta kwedizumba dyakwe dyo useuta? Ulosi wa Waizulaeli wose miye seuta siwiva. <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Nyuwe mwi walukolo wangu, sakame yetu ni imwe, kwabwani mtenda mzigila kunivuza kukaya miye seuta?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Nyuwe mgambileni Amasa, hegu yeye suyo sakame yangu. Naho Chohile anikome hegu sinamtendile yeye atende sekulu ywa awagomba nkondo wangu kukongela dyelo hantu ha Yoabu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Kwa ulosi uwo Daudi kawaluvya awantu wose wa Yuda watende saviya mntu yumwenga. Ivyo niyo wamwigaila seuta ulosi wamgamba, “Uya kaya weye na awandima wako wose.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Ivyo, seuta niyo aita komto wa Yolodani na awantu wose wa Yuda niyo weza wabula Giligali kumsingila seuta na kumdelusa momto wa Yolodani. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimei mwana ywa Gela ywe idikabila dya Benjamini, kulawa Bahulimu, kasunguza kwita hamwenga na wantu watuhu chani wamsingile seuta Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Shimei aitaga hamwenga na wantu watuhu we idikabila dya Benjamini elufu imwenga. Siba mndima ywa awantu we ikaya ya Sauli, hamwenga na wanawe mlongo umwega na washano na wandima milongo midi, wasunguza kwita komto wa Yolodani kumlongoila seuta Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Niyo wadeluka mwedilomo chani wawasindikize awantu we ikaya ya seuta na kumdamanyiza seuta yose aungile.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:18">Daudi alagisa mbazi kwa Shimei</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Shimei mwana ywa Gela niyo eza, edula kulongozi kwa seuta, afika madi na kubula hasi umo seuta endaga hajihi kudeluka umto wa Yolodani. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Shimei niyo amgamba seuta, “Sekulu ywangu seuta nakulombeza usekunifanyanyiza kutenda na mlema hegu kukumbuka ubanasi utendeke idizuwa diya wendile ukakulawa komzi wa Yelusalemu. Mbuli izo usekuzijela mo mtwi. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Kwaviya miye mndima ywako simanya kugamba sikola masa. Ivyo nivyo vikuleka dyelo siza, hatenda ni ywa nkongo mwe idikabila dya Yusufu, siza husingile weye sekulu ywangu seuta.” <verse eid="2SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Abishai, mwana ywa Seluya, niyo agamba, “Togola, Shimei havikuwagila akomwe kwaviya kamligita mntu asagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile kwa kumhaka mavuta?” <verse eid="2SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Mna Daudi niyo agamba, “Nyuwe wana wa Seluya, miye nna ulosi na nyuwe, ni mbwani dyelo mkwetenda wankondo wangu? Togolani! Mweidizuwa dya dyelo akomwe mntu yoyose ywa Izulaeli? Togola, vino dyelo miye simanyize kugamba ni seuta ywa Izulaeli?” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Ivyo, seuta niyo amgamba Shimei, “Weye hokomwe.” Seuta niyo amwelisiza Shimei.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi alagisa mbazi kwa Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Ivyo, Mefibosheti mwezukuluwe dya Sauli, iviya kaita kumsingila seuta Daudi. Kukongela idizuwa diya seuta ahalaile Yelusalemu kubula hadya auyaga mpeho, Mefibosheti endaga hahakile mazi iviga vyakwe hegu kumoga izindevu zakwe naho suche zakwe hazifuile. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Mefibosheti eze abule Yelusalemu kumsingila seuta, Daudi niyo amuza, “Togola, Mefibosheti kwambwani hujesanye hamwenga na miye?” <verse eid="2SA 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Mefibosheti amhitula, “Weye sekulu ywangu seuta, mndima ywangu anidantaga. Kwaviya miye mndima ywako nasimgamba, ‘Nitandikila impunda chani nikwele nite hamwenga na seuta.’ Kwaviya miye mndima ywako siholomala. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Haluse kanizigiliza kwako, weye sekulu ywangu seuta ywangu, weye wisaviya mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile. Damanya dyodyose ukuwona dyakuwagila. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Kwaviya wantu wose we ikaya ya babangu navyunga wakomwe kulongozi kwako, sekulu ywangu seuta. Mna nakunika miye mndima ywako mgati mwa wadya wakudya he meza yako. Ni mbwani hulombeze chintu chituhu weye seuta?” <verse eid="2SA 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Seuta niyo amgamba, “Usekulongesa mwe mbuli zako mwenye. Miye silonga kale weye hamwenga na Siba mpangane isanga ya Sauli.” <verse eid="2SA 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Mefibosheti niyo amgamba seuta, “Mleke Siba aguhe isanga yose ichedu. Miye selelwa kugamba weye sekulu ywangu seuta kuya mpeho kaya.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi alagisa wedi kwa Balizilai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Balizilai kulawa Giliyadi iviya nendile keza kulawa Logelimu kudeluka umto wa Yolodani hamwenga na seuta chani amsindikize kubula ndendele ya kaidi yo mto. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Balizilai endaga kadalahalisa, mihilimo yakwe yendaga milongo mnane. Balizilai amtunduliyaga seuta umo ekelaga uko Mahanaimu, kwaviya endaga mgoli vitendese. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Seuta Daudi niyo amgamba Balizilai, “Chite chose uko Yelusalemu, miye nahutunduliye.” <verse eid="2SA 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Mna Balizilai niyo amgamba seuta, “Mihilimo yangu yo kwikala ni mijeche, nimbwani nite Yelusalemu hekale na weye seuta? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Miye dyelo nina mihilimo milongo mnane. Togola, nadaha kubunkula yedi na yehiye? Togola, miye mndima ywako, nadaha kubunkula mwile wa chiya hudya hegu hunywa? Togola, nadaha kubunkula utana wa lungole lwa wachemi wa chigosi hegu wa chivyele? Nimbwani miye mndima ywako nitende mzigo wa nyambilizi kwako sekulu ywangu seuta? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Miye mndima ywako nanideluke umto wa Yolodani hamwenga na seuta uhale mjihi du, kwambwani seuta aninke jeleko kulu sadino? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Miye mndima ywako nakweila nileka nuye habanikile homzi wangu haguhi ne imbila ya welesi wangu. Mna yuno mndima ywako Kimhamu mleke aite hamwenga na sekulu ywangu seuta. Mdamanyize dyodyose diya ukuwona dyawagila.” <verse eid="2SA 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Seuta niyo amgamba, “Kimhamu naite hamwenga na miye, naho nanimdamanyize dyodyose dikuwagila kwako. Naho chochose ukunga hutendele nahutendele.” <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Ivyo, wantu wose niyo wadeluka umto wa Yolodani, akaheza seuta naye adeluka. Seuta niyo amkubatila Balizilai na kumjimbika, Balizilai niyo auya kukaya kwakwe.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Izulaeli wahigana kumlanga seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Seuta kajendeleza kubula Giliyadi, Kimhamu katimilana hamwenga naye. Wagomba nkondo wose wa Yuda ne inusu ya awagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli nendile wakamsindikiza seuta. <verse eid="2SA 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Vikajika, wantu wose wa Izulaeli niyo waita kwa seuta na kumgamba, “Nimbwani walukolo wetu wantu wa Yuda nendile wakuguha mwesila niyo wakudelusa umto wa Yolodani hamwenga na awantu we ikaya yako na awantu wako?” <verse eid="2SA 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Wantu wa Yuda niyo wawahitula awantu wa Izulaeli, “Chiwadamanya ivyo kwaviya seuta ni mlukolo ywetu ywa hajihi. Nimbwani mkwihiwa kwe imbuli ino? Togolani, chidya chochose chipindi chochose chikalihilwa ni seuta? Hegu uyo kachinka chochose?” <verse eid="2SA 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wawahitula wantu wa Yuda, “Chawagila nkanana mlongo mwa seuta, kujinka nyuwe ivyo mkuwagila, naho hata mwa Daudi. Haluse kwambwani mchibela? Togolani suwe hachendile wa nkongo kulonga kugamba seuta ywetu avuzwe?” Milosi ya awantu wa Yuda yendaga mikali kujinka idya ya awantu wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Sheba amhituka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Uko Giligali kwendaga na mntu yumwenga mwihi akwitangwa Sheba mwana ywa Bikili, ywe idikabila dya Benjamini. Elo, Sheba niyo atowa gunda, na kugamba, “Hachina lukolo na Daudi, hachina hantu hetu mwa uyo mwana ywa Yese. Nyuwe wantu wa Izulaeli, chila yumwenga naite kwedihema dyakwe!” <verse eid="2SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Ivyo, wantu wose wa Izulaeli niyo wamleka Daudi nakumtimila Sheba mwana ywa Bikili. Mna awantu wa Yuda wamtimila seuta Daudi kwa ukanuni kukongela komto wa Yolodani kubula komzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Umo Daudi eze abule kwekaya yakwe komzi wa Yelusalemu. Seuta niyo awaguha wadya ivilaga vyakwe mlongo awasaga chani wamile inyumba yakwe. Niyo awaika mwenyumba imwenga wakamilwa, kawatunduliya vyedi mna hagonile nawo. Ivilaga awo waikagwa mwe chifungo kubula amazuwa yawo yo kubanika, mowikazi wawo wekala saviya wasigwa wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawo. <verse eid="2SA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Vikajika, seuta niyo amgamba Amasa, “Nichisanyiza awagomba nkondo wose wa Yuda mwa amazuwa yano amatatu, wemwenye nawe utendeke aho.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Ivyo, Amasa niyo aita akuwetanga awantu wa Yuda. Mna kakawa ukuya mwa amazuwa yadya alagizwe ni seuta. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Daudi niyo amgamba Abishai, “Haluse Sheba mwana ywa Bikili, nachigaile nkondo kujinka Abusalomu. Waguhe awandima wangu, umsondele Sheba anasekwingila mwemizi izengelwe ngome na kuchulupuka chisekumwona vituhu.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Ivyo, wagomba nkondo wa Yoabu hamwenga na Abishai na Wakeleti na Wapeleshi na wakankalu wose wa wagombankondo niyo wafosa kulawa Yelusalemu wakumwebunga Sheba mwana ywa Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Weze wabule kweyuwe kulu dyendaga uko Gibeoni, Amasa niyo eza kuwahokela. Yoabu nakavala suche zakwe za kugombela nkondo, na mndani mwakwe nakataliza msipi mwe chigudi utozize sime imwe yala yakwe. Umo Yoabu akasogela isime yakwe niyo yasomoka mwe yala yagwa hasi. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yoabu niyo amgamba Amasa, “Togola, wivihi, mlukolo ywangu?” Yoabu niyo amtoza Amasa mwe chilevu nomkono wakwe wa kulume saviya aunga amkumbatile chani walamsane. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Mna Amasa haiwone isime yendile mo mkono wa Yoabu, Yoabu niyo amtunga sime Amasa mwenda, utumbo ufoseza kuse, abanika. Yoabu havuzagize kumtunga sime. Vikaheza Yoabu na mlukolo ywakwe Abishai wajendeleza kumtimila Sheba mwana ywa Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Mntu yumwenga mwa awantu wa Yoabu niyo eza achimala hajihi ne ichimba cha Amasa, agamba, “Yoyose akumunga Yoabu na yoyose akumunga Daudi amtimile Yoabu!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa endile kaumbala mwe sakame yakwe mgati mwesila inkulu, ivyo chila mntu ajinkile aho na kumuwona nendile akachimala. Mna yudya mntu eze awone kugamba wantu wose wezile nawakachimala aho, niyo ausa ichimba cha Amasa hesila achigala kwenkonde na kuchigubika na suche. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Amasa eze ausigwe mwesila inkulu, wantu wose wajendeleza wamtimila Yoabu wamwebata Sheba mwana ywa Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba kajinkila mwa awantu wose wa amakabila ya Izulaeli kubula ko mzi wa Abeli wa Beti Maaka, Wantu wose wo ulukolo lwa Bikili wechisanya na kumtimila. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Wagomba nkondo wose wendile hamwenga na Yoabu niyo waita wamtandama Sheba akatenda eyumo mo mzi wa Abeli wa Beti maaka. Wauzunguluka Sugulu yo umzi, wakonga kuibogozola chani waigwise hasi. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Mvyele yumwenga mta ubala kulawa komzi kevika, akagamba, “Tegelezani! Tegelezani!, Mgambileni Yoabu eze nilonge naye.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Yoabu niyo amsogeila yudya mvyele amuza, “Ni weye Yoabu?” Yoabu niyo ahitula, “Heye! Ni miye.” Yudya mvyele amgamba, “Netegeleza miye mndima ywako.” Yoabu amgamba, “Nakwetegeleza.” <verse eid="2SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Yudya mvyele niyo ajendeleza, “Chikale icho wantu nawakagamba, ‘Uneva wonga ulangilizi hita ukauze komzi wa Abeli.’ Nivyo wantu nawakalamua izimbuli zawo. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Suwe chiwamwenga mwa wadya wakunga utondowazi na ukanuni mweisi ya Izulaeli. Weye kwekamba ubalange umzi wisaviya mami ya mntu mweisi ya Izulaeli. Kwambwani waunga ubalange umzi wa Zumbe Chohile?” <verse eid="2SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yoabu niyo amhitula, “Mowikazi wangu sekambile kugwisa hegu kubalanga umzi. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Ivyo ulongile sicho chindedi! Mna mntu yumwenga ywa kolugulu lwa Efulaimu, akwitangwa Sheba mwana ywa Bikili aunga amhituke seuta Daudi. Mlavyeni uyodu kwangu miye nanimlawe momzi wenyu.” Yudya mvyele niyo amgamba Yoabu, “Umtwi wakwe naudulwe kujinkila mlanga mwe ichiwambaza.” <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Vikaheza, yudya mvyele mo ubala wakwe niyo awabasa awantu wose momzi. Niyo wamkanta umtwi Sheba mwana ywa Bikili wamduila Yoabu uko kuse. Ivyo, Yoabu niyo atowa gunda chani waleke kubogozola ichiwambaza cho umzi uwo wa Abeli, chila mntu niyo aita kwekaya yakwe. Yoabu auyaga kwa seuta Daudi uko Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandima wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Haluse, Yoabu endaga nuyo sekulu ywa awagomba nkondo wose wa Izulaeli. Benaya, mwana ywa Yehoyada, endaga sekulu ywa Wakeleti na Wapeleti awo wendaga ni wamizi wa Daudi mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adolamu nakachimaila ndima za kukunkusa. Yehoshafati endaga mta kuwandika mbuli zilaile. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Shausha endaga mta kuwandika, Sadoki na Abiatali wendaga walavyantambiko. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Ila kulawa komzi wa Yaili iviya endaga mlavyantambiko ywa Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Sauli wakomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Chipindi chimwenga kwagwaga gumbo ditendese mweisi, Daudi nuyo endaga seuta. Gumbo idyo dikala mihilimo mitatu ulonaulo. Daudi niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile ulangilizi. Zumbe Chohile amgamba, “Sauli na awantu we ikaya yakwe wana mlema wa kwitila sakame kwaviya awakomaga Wagibeoni.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Ivyo, seuta niyo awetange Wagibeoni. Wagibeoni hawendaga Waizulaeli, mna ni Waamoli wasigaile. Hata hegu Waizulaeli nendile welisa kuwaleka wajima mna Sauli nakajeza kuwakoma wose kwaviya endaga akahikiliza kuwahingiza awantu wa Izulaeli na awantu wa Yuda. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Ivyo Daudi niyo awagambila Wagibeoni, “Niwatendeleni mbwani? Nanilihe zeze kwa wihi mtendelwe chani muijimbike isi ino na awantu wakwe Zumbe Chohile?” <verse eid="2SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Wagibeoni niyo wamhitula, “Nkumbizi yetu na Sauli hamwenga na awantu we ikaya yakwe haikudaha kusila kwa kulihwa mayuwe ya chumbu hegu zahabu. Hegu suwe kukoma mntu yoyose mweisi ya Izulaeli.” Seuta niyo awauza vituhu, “Haluse mwaunga niwatendeleni mbwani?” <verse eid="2SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Wagibioni niyo wamhitula seuta, “Sauli ekambaga kuchikoma kuchibinda, asekusigaza mntu ywetu yoyose mweisi yose ya Izulaeli. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Elo, chinke welekwa mfungate wa chilume chani chiwanyulike kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile kolugulu lwa Gibeya komzi wa Sauli asagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile.” Elo, Seuta niyo agamba, “Naniwenkeni awantu awo.” <verse eid="2SA 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Mna seuta amhonyaga Mefibosheti, mwana ywa Yonasani kwaviya Daudi aikaga cheliso na Yonasani mwana ywa Sauli welisizana kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Mna seuta niyo awaguha Alimoni na Mefibosheti wana waidi wa Sauli welekwe ni Lisipa mchiche ywa Ahiya na wana washano wa chilume wa Mikali mchiche ywa Sauli welekwe ni Adulieli mwana ywa Balizilai ywe idikabila dya Meholati <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Daudi kawenkiza awo awelekwa mfungate kwa Wagibeoni, niyo wawanyulika kolugulu hantu hokumvikila Zumbe Chohile, wose mfungate wakomwa chahamwenga. Wana awo wakomwa mwenkongelo yo uvuni we shayili. <verse eid="2SA 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Vikaheza, Lisipa mchiche ywa Aya niyo aguha suche ya juniya, atandika he yuwe. Kekala aho kukongela nkongelo yo ulozo kubula chipindi cha fula chize chikonge na kuvinyela ivimba ivyo. Chipindi chose icho, kawabalaza awadege wa kulanga na wanyama wa kumbago, chilo na msi chani wasekuvimbwila ivimba ivyo. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Daudi eze eve yadya atendile Lisipa mchiche ywa Aya, chilaga cha ywa Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />niyo aita akuguha amavuha ya Sauli na mwanawe Yonasani kulawa kwa awantu wa Yabeshi Giliyadi. Wayaguhaga chinyele kulawa mwe ichiwasa cha wantu wose uko Beti shani hantu Wafilisiti wawanyulikaga mwedizuwa diya wamkomaga Sauli uko kolugulu lwa Giliboa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Ivyo, Daudi kavuza amavuha ya Sauli na Yonasani mwana ywa Sauli, akaheza niyo wachisanya amavuha ya wadya awambwanga mfungate wanyulikagwa. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Ivyo, wantu wa Daudi niyo wahamba amavuha ya Sauli na Yonasani mwe isi ya Benjamini, uko Sela mwe mbila ya Kishi tati yakwe dya Sauli. Wadamanya chila chintu chiya seuta alagize. Ivyo vize viheze, Chohile niyo ayetegeleze indilo yawo kwachausa che isi yawo.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkondo ya Waizuleli na Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1Mihilimo 20:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Vikaheza, Wafilisiti niyo wagomba nkondo naho na Waizulaeli. Daudi na awagomba nkondo wakwe niyo waita wakugomba nkondo na Wafilisiti. Daudi asokelesaga uko kwenkondo. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Ishibi Benobu, yumwenga ywa welekwa wa amazintu ayo, uyo guha dyakwe dya shaba dyendaga na uzami ukwinga chilo ntatu na nusu naho nakenyinya sime mpya nakagamba namkome Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Mna Abishai mwana ywa Seluya niyo aita akumwambiza Daudi. Abishai kamwebunga yudya Mfilisiti na kumkoma. Wagomba nkondo niyo wamwelisiza Daudi wakagamba, “Howite hamwenga na suwe vituhu kwenkondo. Weye wimsuhi wa Izulaeli hachikunga kukwaza.” <verse eid="2SA 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Ivyo vize viheze, niyo kwalaila nkondo vituhu na Wafilisiti uko Gobu. Uko Sibekai kulawa lukolo lwa Hushati, amkomaga Safu endaga yumwenga ywa welekwa wa mazintu ya Walefai. <verse eid="2SA 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Kwalailaga nkondo vituhu na Wafilisiti uko Gobu. Elihanani mwana ywa Yaalelo Legimu, Mbetelehemu, amkomaga Goliyati, Mgiti, uyo mhini we idiguha dyakwe wendaga saviya mfunda. <verse eid="2SA 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Niyo kwalaila nkondo vituhu uko Gati, uko kwendaga na zintu tali, dina madole mtandatu chila mkono na madole mtandatu chila chiga, chahamwenga madole yakwe yendaga milongo midi na mane. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Umo awatilaga Waizulaeli, Yonasani mwana ywa Shimei mlukolo ywa Daudi, niyo amkoma. <verse eid="2SA 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Wantu awo wane wendaga welekwa wa mazintu uko Gati, awo wakomagwa ni Daudi hamwenga na awagomba nkondo wakwe.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Nchemo ya Daudi yo uhuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Zumbe Chohile eze amkombole Daudi kulawa mwa awankondo wakwe wose hamwenga na Sauli, niyo amchemela Zumbe nchemo ino.<verse eid="2SA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Kagamba, “Zumbe Chohile ni nchinga yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">ngome yangu naho ni mwambula ywangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Chohile ywangu ni nchinga yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">uyo kwakwe nasumkila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">nchinga yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">nguvu yo wambulwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">ngome yangu naho sumkilo dyangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Mwambula ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">wanambula kulawa kwa wantu manyakwili.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Namwitanga Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">akuwagila ntogozi anambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">miye nambulwa kulawa kwa awankondo wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Kwaviya mawimbi ya file nayanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:5">mazi yalozize nayanebunga.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Mitego ye isi ya wabanike inogofya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:6">mitego ya file nendile inibasa.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Mwe izinkunto zangu, simwitanga Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">simwitanga Chohile ywangu anambize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">Kulawa mwe inyumba yakwe evaga idizwi dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">kuiva indilo yangu umo halombeza wambizi.”<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />“Aho isi izingiza na kusingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">vyegamilo vya kwembingu videgadega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">kwaviya Chohile nendile kehiwa!<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Mosi uvunka kulawa mwe impula yakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">Moto ukoka niyo walawa mo mlomo wakwe, makala ya moto yalibuka kulawa mo mlomo wakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Katula ulanga, niyo asela hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">na ingu titu nendile dihasi heviga vyakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Kakwela mwe chumbe china mawawa chikwitangwa kelubi niyo apuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">kakwela kulanga kwa nkung'unto saviya mawawa.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Kezungulusiza chiza ntendele zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:12">kegubika chiza ntendele zose, ngubiko yakwe yendaga maingu yazamile ya fula.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Lumwemwe lumulika kulongozi kwakwe kulibula nkala za moto.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Zumbe Chohile niyo abuma kulawa kwembingu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 22:14">Chohile Mkulu niyo alavya izwi dyakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Kawalasa mifulo na kuwatimulaganya wankondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">kamulika lumwemwe na kuwatimula.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Zumbe Chohile eze awakwahile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kulawana na umuye we impula yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">mizumilizo yebahali igubulwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">vyegamo vyeisi niyo vyawoneka.”<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />“Chohile achulusaga umkono wakwe kulawa kulanga niyo aniguha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">kulawa mwe mzumilizo wa mazi kaninula.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Anambulaga kulawa mwe mnkondo ywangu mta nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">anambulaga kulawa mwa wadya wanihiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">kwaviya wendaga wakanihuma nguvu.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Nawanebunga umo nendaga mwezinkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:19">mna Zumbe Chohile endaga nchinga yangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Kanigala na kunika hantu hehene nkama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:20">kwaviya nakawagilwa ni miye.”<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />“Zumbe Chohile anitendelaga wedi kuligana na ukanuni wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:21">kanijeleka kwaviya sikoile masa.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Kwaviya sitimila izisila za Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:22">naho sesentile na Chohile ywangu kwa ubanasi.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Sitoza amalagizo yakwe yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:23">naho silekile kutimila imiko yakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Kulongozi kwakwe senega na mlema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:24">senega kutenda na mlema.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Zumbe Chohile kanijeleka kuligana na ukanuni wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:25">uyo kamanya uwagila wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />“Weye wimkanuni kwa wadya awakanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:26">wiywedi kwa wadya wata wedi.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Weye kuchuma kwa wadya wachumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:27">mna kwa wankani wawagwisiza nkondo.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Weye wawambumbula wadya wakunyanyahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:28">mna wawakaula wadya wakweduvya wanyanyahale.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Weye Zumbe Chohile weye wi taa yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:29">Chohile ywangu ukubalaza ziza dyangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Kwa wambizi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">nadaha kuwebunga wankondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">weye waninka nguvu za kupilika iviwambaza vyakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Akudamanya Zumbe hachina lema!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">Ndagano ya Zumbe Chohile niya ukanuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">uyo ni nchinga kwa wose wakumgulukila.”<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />“Ni yuhi esaviya Chohile ukaleka Zumbe Chohile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:32">Ni yuhi esaviya luwe lwa kusumkila kwegombela ukaleka Chohile ywetu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Chohile yuno nuyo sumkilo dyangu ditogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:33">naho isila yangu kaitenda itondowale.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Katogeza iviga vyangu saviya vya kapala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:34">na kunika kwa utondowala kulanga kwevinenengwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Anihinya kugomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:35">mikono yangu idahe kukwesa uta wa shaba.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Kunidima na kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:36">wambizi wako unitenda mkulu.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Kwangamula isila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:37">naho iviga vyangu haviteile.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Siwagulusa awankondo wangu na kuwakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:38">siwiye kunyuma kubula wabalangwa.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Siwabalangisa na kuwagwisa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">wadunduga kwinuka vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">wagwela heviga vyangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Weye kuninka nguvu za kugomba nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:40">kuninka uhuda mwa wankondo wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Kuwatenda awankondo wangu wasumke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:41">na wadya wanihiwe siwabalanga.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Walonda wambizi mna hahendaga na ywa kuwambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">wamwilila Zumbe Chohile mna hawahitule.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Siwabunda na kuwahonda saviya lumbi dye isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:43">niyo nawahonda na kuwajata saviya ntagata mwesila.”<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />“Weye wanambulaga kulawa mwa awantu wangu wanebungaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">kunitenda nilongoze wantu wa izisi ntuhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">Wantu simanyize wanisankanila.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Wajeni wanibasaga wakanyanyahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:45">weze weve izimbuli zangu niyo wanizumila.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Wajeni wafaga chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:46">niyo weza kulawa mwe izingome zawo wakazingiza.”<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />“Zumbe Chohile ni mjima!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Atogolwe mwamizi ywangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Atogolwe Chohile ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">mwamizi na wambulwa wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Uyo kanidahiza kuliha chikoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:48">kuhosa wantu wa izisi ntuhu watende hasi ho ulongozi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />Kanambula kulawa kwa awankondo wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">Weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">kuninka uhuda mwa awahigani wangu na kunihonya hale na wantu manyakwili.”<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />“Elo, nahutogole mgati mwa awantu we izisi ntuhu, weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">nanidichemele ntogozi idizina dyako.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Chohile amwinka seuta ywakwe uhuda mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">amlagisa mbazi zakwe uyo asentile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">heye amlagisa mbazi Daudi na welekwa wakwe mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Milosi ya kubindiliza ya udumo ya Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Ino ni milosi yo udumo ya Daudi. Ni ulosi wa Daudi mwanawe dya Yese, ulosi wa mntu atendigwe mkulu ni Chohile. Chohile ywa Yakobo kamsagula Daudi atende seuta, nchemo zakwe Waizulaeli wabwedaga kuzichema.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />“Muye wa Zumbe Chohile walongaga kujinkila kwangu, aikaga milosi mwemilomo yangu. <verse eid="2SA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Chohile ywa Izulaeli kalonga, mdimi ywa Izulaeli kanigambila, ‘Mntu akalongoza wantu vikuwagila, akalongoza kwa kutimila isila ya Chohile, <verse eid="2SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />uyo ni saviya ulangazi wa mtondo, zuwa dikatontomoka mtondo hekwine maingu, heye saviya fula ikuhosa mani mwesanga.’ <verse eid="2SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Ivyo nivyo Chohile akunga ajimbike ulukolo lwangu. Kwaviya kadamanya lagano na miye dikwikala mazuwa yose, lagano dichintile naho ditogile. Uyo nanitende nichumilwe mwe izimbuli zangu zose. <verse eid="2SA 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Mna hewemmanyize Chohile wose ni saviya miwa ikudulwa du, kwaviya haikutozeka, <verse eid="2SA 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Yoyose akuchisanya miwa ajeseza chiya cha chuma hegu mhini wa guha. Wantu awo nawatikimye moto.”<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagomba nkondo wakankalu wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1Mihilimo 11:10-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Yano nayo amazina ya wantu wakankalu wendaga na Daudi, Yoshebu Bashebeti kulawa Takemoni endaga nuyo chilongozi mwa wadya watatu, uyo agombaga nkondo kwa guha dyakwe na wantu magana mnane niyo awakoma zuwa dimwenga. <verse eid="2SA 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Mkankalu ywa kaidi endaga Eliazali mwana dya Dodo kulawa mo lukolo lwa Hohi. Zuwa dimwenga Eliazali endaga na Daudi niyo wawahuluta Wafilisiti wechisanyaga chani wagombe nkondo. Waizulaeli watuhu niyo wawasumka Wafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Mna Eliazali niyo achimala chigosi agomba nkondo na Wafilisiti kubula umkono wakwe uchuluka usigala ukagatila isime yakwe. Zuwa idyo Zumbe Chohile epatilaga uhuda mkulu. Vikaheza uhuda uwo, Waizulaeli niyo wauya ahantu hadya endile Eliazali wataha vintu vya bule vya Wafilisiti wakomigwe. <verse eid="2SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Mkankalu ywa katatu endaga ni Shama mwana ywa Agee kulawa mo lukolo lwa Halali. Wafilisiti wechisanyaga uko Lehi, hantu hendega na nkonde ya dengu zilozize, Waizulaeli watuhu wawasumkaga Wafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Mna Shama niyo achimala chigosi hagatigati he inkonde iyo akaigombela isekuguhigwa, uyo niyo awakoma Wafilisiti. Zumbe Chohile epatilaga uhuda mkulu mwe idizuwa idyo. <verse eid="2SA 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Chipindi cho uvuni vilongozi watatu wakankalu mgati mwa vilongozi milongo mitatu waselezaga wakambasa Daudi kwempanga uko Adulamu. Chipindi icho wagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti nawaika lago kwedikolongo dya Lefeimu. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Chipindi icho Daudi endaga mwempanga ikwamiliswa, wagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti wendaga komzi wa Betelehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Daudi nendile kakalukwa aunga mazi kulawa kwawo, niyo agamba, “Nabesa mntu adahile kuninka mazi ya kuywa kulawa kwe idisima dihajihi ne nchili yo umzi wa Betelehemu!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Elo, wadya wakankalu wakwe watatu niyo wafosa wafifinya hagatigati ha awagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti, waita na kuteka mazi mwedisima dihajihi ne nchili yo umzi wa Betelehemu, niyo wamwigaila Daudi. Mna Daudi mazi ayo hayanywele hantu hakwe kayetila hasi saviya ntambiko kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Niyo agamba, “Havikujezwa, sikuwagilwa kunywa yano amazi, weye Zumbe Chohile, togola yano hayakunga sakame ya wadya wawambaze ujima wawo kwigala amazi yano?” Ivyo amazi ayo Daudi hayanywele. Mbuli izo nizo wadamanye wakankalu awo watatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abishai mvunawe dwa Yoabu mwana ywa Seluya endaga sekulu ywa wakankalu milongo mitatu. Uyo agombaga nkondo na wantu magana matatu kwa guha dyakwe niyo awakoma, ivyo uyo naye niyo enkwa ntogozi saziya za awo watatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Endaga kamanyikisa mwa wadya wakankalu milongo mitatu. Ivyo niyo atenda sekulu ywawo, mna hatendile mkankalu saviya wadya wakankalu watatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Beneya mwanawe dya Yehoyada endaga mgomba nkondo mkankalu kulawa Kabuzeli, uyo adamanyaga mbuli zilozize za ukankalu. Akomaga wakankalu waidi kulawa Moabu, naho zuwa dimwenga chipindi cha balafu aselaga kwe bome na kukoma simba. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Iviya akomaga zintu kulawa Misili. Mmisili uyo endaga na guha, mna Benaya ambasaga akatenda na nkome du, niyo amhoka idyo idiguha, Mmisili uyo kakomwa kwa guha dyakwe mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Izo zendaga mbuli za ukankalu adamanye Benaya mwana ywa Yehoyada, naye niyo atenda na ntogozi nkulu saziya za wadya wakankalu watatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Elo, niyo atenda ni mntu amanyikise mgati mwa wadya wakankalu milongo mitatu mna hatendile sawadya wakankalu watatu. Daudi niyo amwinka ndima ya ulongozi mwa awamizi wakwe mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Yano na amazina ya masekulu wakankalu. Asaheli mlukolo ywa Yoabu endaga eyumo mgati mwa awo wakankalu milongo mitatu. Wakankalu watuhu wa Daudi wendaga, Elihanani mwana ywa Dodo kulawa Betelehemu; <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shama na Elika kulawa kolukolo lwa Halodi, <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Helesi kulawa komzi wa Peleti na Ila mwana ywa Ikeshi kulawa komzi wa Tekoa, <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiezeli kulawa komzi wa Anatoti na Mebunai kulawa kolukolo lwa Hushati, <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Salimoni zina dyakwe tuhu naketangwa Ilai kulawa kolukolo lwa Ahohi na Mahalai kulawa komzi wa Netofati, <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Helebu mwanawe dya Baana iviya kalaila komzi wa Netofati na Itai mwanawe dya Libai kulawa komzi wa Gibeya kweisi ye idikabila dya Benjamini, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaya kulawa komzi wa Pilatoni na Hidai kulawa kwemito ya Gaashi, <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abi Aliboni kulawa kolukolo lwa Alabati na Azimaweti kulawa komzi wa Bahulimu, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliaba kulawa komzi wa Shaliboni na wanawe dya Yasheni na Yonasani, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Shama kulawa kolukolo lwa Halalina na Ahimu mwanawe dya Shalali kulawa ko ulukolo lwa Halali, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Elifeleti mwana ywa Ahasibai kulawa komzi wa Maaka na Eliamu mwanawe dya Ahitofeli kulawa komzi wa Gilo, <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Hezilo kulawa komzi wa Kalimeli na Palai kulawa komzi wa Aliba, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igali mwana ywa Nasani kulawa komzi wa Soba na Bani kulawa kwe idikabila dya Gadi, <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Seleki kulawa kwa awantu wa Amoni na Nahalai kulawa komzi wa Beloti, uyo endaga mwinula viziha ywa Yoabu mwana ywa Seluya, <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ila na Galebu kulawa komzi wa Jatili, <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />Uliya mgosiwe dya Basisheba. Wose chahamwenga wendaga wakankalu milongo mitatu na mfungate.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi awaza awantu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 21:1-27">1Mihilimo 21:1-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Chohile niyo emukwa ni maya vituhu mwa awantu wa Izulaeli, niyo amsonga maya Daudi mwawo, amgamba, “Hita ukawaze awantu wa Izulaeli na Yuda.” <verse eid="2SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Elo, seuta niyo amgamba Yoabu, hamwenga na masekulu wa wagomba nkondo nendile ehamwenga nawo, “Hitani kwa amakabila yose ya Izulaeli kukongela isi ya Dani ntendele ya chenya kubula Batisheba wazani awantu wose naunga nimanye kugamba niwengahi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Mna Yoabu niyo amhitula seuta, “Zumbe Chohile ywako awajenyeze Waizulaeli nkanana gana dimwenga kujinka ivyo weli haluse, wenawe sekulu ywangu seuta uwone mwenye kwa meso yako ukujenyezwa uko. Mna ni mbwani weye sekulu ywangu seuta waunga utende vino?” <verse eid="2SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Mna ulosi alongile seuta wendaga na nguvu kujinka ulosi wa Yoabu na masekulu wa awagomba nkondo! Elo, Yoabu na masekulu wa wagomba nkondo niyo wahalawa halongozi ha seuta, waita wakuwawaza Waizulaeli. <verse eid="2SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Wadeluka umto wa Yolodani niyo waika lago hajihi no umzi wa Aloeli, ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi wikwedikolongo kuhinga kweisi ya Gadi kubula Yezeli. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Waita kubula kweisi ya Giliyadi wakaheza waita Kadeshi kweisi ya Wahiti, niyo wabula kweisi ye idikabila dya Dani wazunguluka wahinga Sidoni. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Wakaheza ni wahinga kwengome yo umzi wa Tilo, niyo wengila kwemizi yose ya Wahivi na Wakanani. Weze waheze niyo waita ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Yuda uko Balisheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Weze wajinke mwe isi yose niyo wauya Yelusalemu ize ijinke myezi chenda na mazuwa milongo midi wakatenda wabinda kujinka mwe isi yose kuwawaza awantu. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Yoabu niyo amwigaila seuta uwazwa wa awantu. Izulaeli kwendaga na wagosi wakankalu laki mnane wata udahi wa kugomba nkondo kwa sime na kweisi ya Yuda kwendaga na wagosi laki shano. <verse eid="2SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Mna Daudi niyo asungulumanywa vitendese mo moyo wakwe eze aheze kuwawaza awantu. Elo, Daudi niyo amgamba Zumbe Chohile, “Sikola masa vitendese kwa mbuli nidamanye. Mna haluse, weye Zumbe Chohile nakweila unilekeile miye mndima ywako, kwaviya sidamanya mbuli yo uvambi vitendese.” <verse eid="2SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Mtondo wakwe Daudi henati kwinuka, Zumbe Chohile kamwinka ulosi wakwe muwoni Gadi, endile mlotezi ywa seuta Daudi, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Hita kamgambile Daudi, ‘Vino nivyo akulonga Zumbe, nakwinka mbuli ntatu, sagula imwenga ukunga hutendele.’” <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Elo, muwoni Gadi niyo aita akumgambila Daudi, amgamba, “Togola, waunga gumbo digwe mwe isi yako kwa mihilimo mfungate? Hegu weye uwasumke awankondo wako myezi mitatu wakakubalaza? Hegu kutende na mazuwa matatu ya nyonje dikutisa mweisi yako? Lungumula ukajika sagula dimwenga hamhitule uyo anisigile.” <verse eid="2SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Daudi niyo amhitula Gadi, Nna nkama ikulise! Mna havinani nikantilwe ni Zumbe Chohile kwaviya ana mbazi, ukaleka nikantilwe ni wantu. <verse eid="2SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Elo, Zumbe Chohile niyo awegaila Waizulaeli unyonje ukwitangwa tauni, kukongela mtondo kubula chipindi chikigwe. Wantu elufu milongo mfungate wabanikaga mwe isi yose kukongela Dani kubula Balisheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Mna mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile umo achuluse umkono wakwe kuhinga komzi wa Yelusalemu chani aubalange, Zumbe Chohile niyo ahituila fanyanyi zakwe za kujendeleza kuwakantila awantu, niyo amgamba, “Leka! Viheza, vuza umkono wako.” Mndima ywa kwembingu nendile kachimala hajihi ne ichiwasa chokuhetela uhule cha mntu akwitagwa Alauna ywe idikabila dya Wayebusi. <verse eid="2SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Daudi eze amwone uyo mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile nendile akakoma awantu, niyo amgamba Zumbe Chohile, “Kaula! Miye ni miye nikoile masa na kutenda na mlema! Wano awantu wahoile hawabalange chintu. Haluse nakweila nikantila miye na awantu we ikaya yangu.” <verse eid="2SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Idizuwa idyo Gadi niyo ambasa Daudi amgamba, “Kwela kuchenya kwechiwasa cho kuhetela uhule cha Alauna, Myebusi ukamzengele mazabahu Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Elo, Daudi niyo akwela kuchenya atimila ulosi wa Gadi Zumbe Chohile alagize. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Alauna eze akaule ntendele ya hasi niyo amwona seuta na awantu wakwe wambasa yeye, uyo niyo aita ambasa na kumfikila madi kubula hasi. <verse eid="2SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Alauna niyo amuza seuta, “Ni mbwani seuta ywangu kwiza kwa miye mndima ywako?” Daudi niyo amhitula “Siza nigule ichiwasa chako cho kuhutila ulozo nimzengele mazabahu Zumbe Chohile chani nyonje dino dye tauni dyusike.” <verse eid="2SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Alauna niyo amhitula Daudi, “Sekulu ywangu seuta, guha chimpandwa chochose ukuwona chawagila ulavize ntambiko. Miye nalavya izinjeku zitende ntambiko ya kutikimya nevimpandwa vyo kuhetela ne imiti yawo zikukweseza zitende nkuni.” <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Alauna niyo agamba, “Vino vyose sekulu nakwinka. Nafanyanya kugamba Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako azumile intambiko yako.” <verse eid="2SA 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Mna seuta niyo amhitula Alauna, “Bule, usekuninka chochose. Miye nanivigule kwe idiyombe dyakwe. Sanimlavize Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu ntambiko za kutikimya silavize chintu chochose.” Ivyo Daudi niyo agula ichiwasa icho cho kuhetela ne izinjeku kwa mayuwe ya chumbu vihande milongo mishano. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Daudi niyo amzengela mazabahu Zumbe Chohile ahantu aho na kumlaviza ntambiko za kutikimya na za utondowazi. Elo, Zumbe Chohile niyo azumila amalombezo kwachausa cha awantu we isi ya Izulaeli, nyonje idyo niyo dyosika.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>